{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T14:25:53.094Z","ordinal":389942,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_060b64278a9dfb15016adf62ecb47c81a09b8bf293c6637179","status":"completed","call_id":"call_6e93eab0315b4729a75f966747c8c590","name":"exec","input":"const r=await tools.mcp__mcp_search__work_state_write({list:\"nexus-v1-release\",fields:{rc7_upgrade_error:\"Verified: user’s RC6/RC7 updater rejected GitHub’s signed release-assets redirect. RC7 source (431cb194931f09eaaffdb6880dc464c1d7b5e2a1) lacks release-assets host allowance and logs the complete URL. Published RC8 tag commit bbafae868939084ccd49f21621695dff6b05f752 adds HTTPS host/path-scoped allowance and origin-only diagnostics. Downloaded RC8 archive SHA256 matches release SHA256SUMS; gh attestation verify passed for archive and checksum index; isolated unpack reports 1.0.0-rc.8 (bbafae868939); package manifest passes and packaged upgrade.js contains allowlist/redaction. RC8 CI40279197785, CodeQL40279197561, Release40283394697, cross-runner40286712425 all SUCCESS exact SHA. RC8 remains prerelease/unaccepted. Do not retry `nexus upgrade` from RC6/RC7; bootstrap via exact published RC8 installer, verify its published digest and run with NEXUS_VERSION=v1.0.0-rc.8, preferably with NEXUS_VERIFY_ATTESTATION=1 on mike-dev. No remote install performed: SSH host identity still needs trusted verification; Ubuntu GH auth is on a separate host.\",pr256_status:\"PR #256 current head c3bb2235286a154280f8578458a4dc8570ae542a; exact independent review CHANGES_REQUIRED for unrelated provider.cancel clearing provisional local endpoint. Implementer /root/current_main_rc_path_audit holds claims and is working on request-matched cancellation, explicit local picker clear, regressions; no tests running yet. Exact CI40338957629 Node22/24 IN_PROGRESS, CodeQL40338957381 SUCCESS. No push/integration until fix, focused validation, fresh independent ACCEPT, and exact-head checks.\"}});text(r)\n","internal_chat_messag