{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T14:26:56.010Z","ordinal":389967,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17885-133d-7581-bd2d-36a0306191af","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adf632c6ed881a088f9d06390f8d20e","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"That error is the RC7 updater rejecting GitHub’s signed asset redirect. RC7’s validator does not allow that host, so retrying `nexus upgrade` from RC6 will hit the same old code.\n\nI verified the published RC8 archive: its checksum and attestations pass, and its packaged updater contains the narrowly scoped redirect allowance and redacts signed URL parameters. The archive reports `1.0.0-rc.8 (bbafae868939)`. RC8’s CI, release workflow, and cross-runner workflow also passed on that exact revision. It remains an unaccepted prerelease.\n\nSince RC6 cannot download the fix through its own updater, bootstrap RC8 with the published installer on **mike-dev**. The GitHub sign-in you completed on Ubuntu does not carry over to mike-dev.\n\n```sh\nmkdir -p /tmp/nexus-rc8-bootstrap\ncd /tmp/nexus-rc8-bootstrap\ngh release download v1.0.0-rc.8 -R mikeholownych/nexus-code -p install.sh\nprintf '%s  install.sh\\n' '5620d56ef6f8d637fc102ae2c8ea3b055effbc4069243a2df68b67520b1e2302' | sha256sum --check -\ngh auth status\nNEXUS_VERSION=v1.0.0-rc.8 NEXUS_VERIFY_ATTESTATION=1 sh ./install.sh\nnexus --version\n```\n\nI did not install anything on mike-dev. The verified updater is in the [RC8 package](/tmp/nexus-rc8-release-verification-20261026/unpack/nexus/lib/cli/dist/upgrade.js:515), and the [published RC8 release](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc.8) is available. Acceptance remains **IN_PROGRESS**; the separate local-provider PR is still awaiting its cancellation fix and exact-head review."}],"phase":"final_answer"},"started_at_ms":1793024812473,"completed_at_ms":1793024816010}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T14:26:56.017Z","ordinal":389968,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","status":"completed","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adf632c6ed881a088f9d06390f8d20e","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"That error is the RC7 updater rejecting GitHub’s signed asset redirect. RC7’s validator does not allow that host, so retrying `nexus upgrade` from RC6 will hit the same old code.\n\nI verified the published RC8 archive: its checksum and attestations pass, and its packaged updater contains the narrowly scoped redirect allowance and redacts signed URL parameters. The archive reports `1.0.0-rc.8 (bbafae868939)`. RC8’s CI, release workflow, and cross-runner workflow also passed on that exact revision. It remains an unaccepted prerelease.\n\nSince RC6 cannot download the fix through its own updater, bootstrap RC8 with the published installer on **mike-dev**. The GitHub sign-in you completed on Ubuntu does not carry over to mike-dev.\n\n```sh\nmkdir -p /tmp/nexus-rc8-bootstrap\ncd /tmp/nexus-rc8-bootstrap\ngh release download v1.0.0-rc.8 -R mikeholownych/nexus-code -p install.sh\nprintf '%s  install.sh\\n' '5620d56ef6f8d637fc102ae2c8ea3b055effbc4069243a2df68b67520b1e2302' | sha256sum --check -\ngh auth status\nNEXUS_VERSION=v1.0.0-rc.8 NEXUS_VERIFY_ATTESTATION=1 sh ./install.sh\nnexus --version\n```\n\nI did not install anything on mike-dev. The verified updater is in the [RC8 package](/tmp/nexus-rc8-release-verification-20261026/unpack/nexus/lib/cli/dist/upgrade.js:515), and the [published RC8 release](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc.8) is available. Acceptance remains **IN_PROGRESS**; the separate local-provider PR is still awaiting its cancellation fix and exact-head review.","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17885-133d-7581-bd2d-36a0306191af","create_time":1793024812.4364328,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]