d byte-for-byte across the two runner outputs and the public release. An isolated install reports `1.0.0-rc.7 (431cb194931f)`. These are artifact and installation checks, not product qualification.\n\n**Qualification and human evidence:** Public Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains open; its latest comment is coordinator-authored at 2026-10-25 06:51 UTC, with no independent custodian acceptance or evaluator-compatible held-out corpus disposition. Held-out T2 has not started, and no private payload was accessed. Provider/standalone qualification and T3/T4 evidence remain incomplete. The five-environment by three-size manual terminal matrix remains 0/15, with no per-cell verdicts or required screenshots. The `cli/src/agent.ts` remediation handoff remains with KimiCode-defect-scan; implementation is still pending in that claimed lane.\n\n**Disposition:** Acceptance is `IN_PROGRESS`; RC7 is not accepted and no stable release is claimed. The next release candidate must include the merged checkpoint fix, pass exact-source CI and qualification gates, and be installed and identified before product qualification. Remaining gates include independent held-out custody and T2, provider/standalone behavior, T3/T4, all 15 human terminal cells, and independent exact-RC acceptance. Publication authorization remains granted once every required gate passes.\n\n## Superseded release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-25 23:43 UTC at `431cb194931f09eaaffdb6880dc464c1d7b5e2a1`)\n\n## Earlier release checkpoint (superseded; observed 2026-10-25 23:43 UTC at `431cb194931f09eaaffdb6880dc464c1d7b5e2a1`)\n\n**Release state:** GitHub lists `v1.0.0-rc.6` as the latest published prerelease. Signed tag `v1.0.0-rc.7` (tag object `d1f79e58a27c0f79f1663f662a153ae4ec5a7824`) now points to source `431cb194931f09eaaffdb6880dc464c1d7b5e2a1`; Release workflow [40246054889](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40246054889) is in progress. GitHub has not published an RC7 release or assets yet. RC6 is not an accepted RC, and no stable `v1.0.0` release is claimed.\n\n**Exact `main` source gates:** Current `origin/main` is `431cb194931f09eaaffdb6880dc464c1d7b5e2a1`. Post-merge CodeQL run [40243331241](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40243331241) passed on this exact SHA. Post-merge CI run [40243331324](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40243331324) completed successfully on this exact SHA: Node 22, Node 24, and Linux x86-64 packaging/reproducibility, SBOM, smoke, and installer checks passed. At this exact source, `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` passed in a detached worktree with isolated HOME/XDG: 123 rows (108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open), with 12 requirements explicitly deferred to exact-RC qualification. These source gates do not constitute installed-RC acceptance.\n\n**Candidate changes:** PR #241 merged source/version preparation at `431cb194`, and signed RC7 tag `v1.0.0-rc.7` points to that exact source. PR #243 is refreshed onto exact base `431cb194` at head `a563eee0206d1287f5375a0ae113b1ca392fffd1`. Its CodeQL and JavaScript/TypeScript checks passed; its exact-head Node 22 and Node 24 matrix jobs are running in CI run [40244800085](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40244800085). Independent source review accepted the exact candidate diff. PR #244 updates only this readiness document at head `0618fbc9d123043506f76eacf9753892cdd06963`; its CodeQL, JavaScript/TypeScript, Node 22, and Node 24 checks passed, while Linux packaging is running in [40243816407](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40243816407). PR #245 updates four manifests/lockfiles for the completed Cloudflare experiment at head `13a955dbe156daec996fd97cfe6946024a3f0b48`; CodeQL, JavaScript/TypeScript, Node 22, and Node 24 passed, and Linux packaging is running in [40244355480](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/