{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T14:32:29.948Z","ordinal":390241,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a178a0-8bfc-7803-94ae-5ea8c12efba3","call_id":"call_e94d031e2001464bb866480a50e060c5","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 3.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"c84c34\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.823937163,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":10283,\"output\":\"Warning: truncated output (original token count: 10283)\\nTotal output lines: 150\\n\\n# v1.0.0 release readiness checkpoint\\n\\n## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-26 13:45 UTC)\\n\\n**Authoritative source and source gates:** `origin/main` is `b73b6ecaf753ff3eba8d5e1930ede7a471359421`, integrating PR #252 (`7f52ed1b76e2fa69dee1416d1b13f1e1263ff52d`) and PR #254 (`b73b6ecaf753ff3eba8d5e1930ede7a471359421`). Exact-main CI run [40327501470](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40327501470) and CodeQL runs [40327501389](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40327501389) and [40331254134](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40331254134) passed on this source. The release requirements enforcement (123 rows; 12 explicitly deferred to exact-RC qualification) and version synchronization checks passed; synchronized components remain `1.0.0-rc.8`.\\n\\n**Candidate and publication state:** Public prerelease [v1.0.0-rc.8](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc.8) remains the latest release, but its tag resolves to `bbafae868939084ccd49f21621695dff6b05f752`, before PR #252 and PR #254. Its Linux archive digest remains `sha256:bbded963a9bcaa9c0764b86d900f752c46ed364bfe30cc67e5bbf23b5fb5f48e`. RC8 reproducibility and isolated-prefix provenance checks apply only to that earlier artifact. It is not an accepted RC for current `main`; a candidate from the current source must be rebuilt and qualified. No stable `v1.0.0` release exists. The RC8 signing identity remains reported by GitHub as unverified (`bad_email`); stable signing must use a GitHub-verified identity.\\n\\n**Acceptance blockers:** Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains open. The latest public metadata-only custody request (12:18 UTC) has no custodian response; do not access held-out payloads or begin the held-out run before independent custody acceptance. The last recorded human terminal matrix is 0/15, with real-terminal operator evidence still required. Exact-current-RC installed qualification, standalone/provider acceptance, T2/T3/T4 qualification and independent exact-RC acceptance are not established. Acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`; publication authorization remains granted but gated on all required acceptance and stable-artifact checks.\\n\\nThe 08:05 checkpoint immediately below is retained as historical evidence; this update supersedes its source, CI, candidate and current blocker status.\\n\\n## Historical checkpoint (observed 2026-10-26 08:05 UTC)\\n\\n**Authoritative source and source gates:** `origin/main` is `bbafae868939084ccd49f21621695dff6b05f752`. Exact-main CI run [40279197785](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40279197785) completed successfully on this commit; all three required jobs (`test-matrix (22)`, `test-matrix (24)`, and `linux-x86_64`) passed. CodeQL run [40279197561](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40279197561) passed. The requirements enforcement and version synchronization checks passed on the same source: 123 requirements (108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 12 remain explicitly deferred to exact-RC qualification), with package components at `1.0.0-rc.8`.\\n\\n**RC8 construction and reproducibility:** Public prerelease [v1.0.0-rc.8](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc.8) was published at 07:26 UTC and resolves to the exact source commit above. Its Linux archive has GitHub asset digest `sha256:bbded963a9bcaa9c0764b86d900f752c46ed364bfe30cc67e5bbf23b5fb5f48e`. Cross-runner RC reproducibility workflow [40286712425](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40286712425) completed successfully against that exact tag, including Ubuntu 22.04 and 24.04 builds and artifact comparison. An installed RC8 copy was also provenance-verified on the Ubuntu desktop in an isolated qualification prefix ([setup record](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/3#issuecomment-6411066559)); this was not the user's normal Nexus installation and is not full installed-RC acceptance. The tag's local GPG signature verifies, but GitHub reports it as unverified (`bad_email`); the stable tag must use a signer identity that GitHub verifies against the signing key. The earlier RC6-to-RC7 upgrade attempt failed because RC6 rejected GitHub's signed release-asset redirect. The redirect allowlist and URL-secret redaction are present in RC8; the RC6 installation was not changed by the isolated RC8 check.\\n\\n**Acceptance blockers:** Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains OPEN; the custodian has not responded to the metadata-only request, and private custody acceptance, evaluator compatibility and sealing are not established. Held-out qualification has not started. Exact-RC provider/standalone qualification, T2/T3 and nine-class T4 qualification, and independent RC acceptance remain incomplete. The human terminal matrix remains 0/15; automated PTY checks do not satisfy it. Stable `v1.0.0` is not published. Campaign status remains `NEXUS_V1_CONVERGENCE_ACTIVE`; acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`; publication authorization remains granted but gated on acceptance.\\n\\nThe 06:24 checkpoint immediately below is retained as a historical snapshot; this update supersedes its CI conclusion, RC publication state, cross-runner status, and current blocker summary.\\n\\n## Historical checkpoint (observed 2026-10-26 06:24 UTC at `bbafae868939084ccd49f21621695dff6b05f752`)\\n\\n**Authoritative source and source gates:** `origin/main` is `bbafae868939084ccd49f21621695dff6b05f752`, incorporating PR #249 (`8e562b0f3406e94003806746cb69a5258f72a59f`) and PR #250. PR #249 merged at 05:57 UTC and PR #250 merged at 06:20 UTC. On this exact source, `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` passed with 123 rows (108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 12 requirements explicitly deferred to exact-RC qualification), and `node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check` confirms all components are `1.0.0-rc.8`. CodeQL run [40279197561](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40279197561) passed. Exact-main CI [40279197785](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40279197785) is still running; its Node 22 and Node 24 jobs passed Rust tests and release builds and were running the CLI test suite at 06:24 UTC. The current checkpoint does not claim full CI success.\\n\\n**RC and publication state:** The latest public prerelease remains `v1.0.0-rc.7`; `v1.0.0-rc.8` is not yet tagged or published. No stable `v1.0.0` release exists. The `rc.8` source version is not itself evidence of an accepted or installed RC. No release artifact should be published until every required acceptance gate passes.\\n\\n**Acceptance blockers:** Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1), for h…6883 tokens truncated… and Xvfb but not the other terminal applications. Xvfb and PTY evidence do not satisfy the manual gate. The operator selected an Ubuntu/GNOME desktop as the target, but a direct SSH probe failed because `ubuntu-desktop` does not resolve from this runner and no desktop host is connected. The worksheet remains unfilled; no terminal cell is claimed passed. Matrix execution still requires the exact candidate artifact selected for qualification, installed and identified on that desktop.\\n\\n**Release disposition and next actions:** Campaign status is `NEXUS_V1_CONVERGENCE_ACTIVE`; acceptance is `IN_PROGRESS`. RC3 is published but unaccepted; no stable v1.0.0 release is claimed. Exact-main CI and CodeQL now pass on `1f3c655`; the pinned-builder documentation claim still needs a safe owner handoff and reconciliation. Continue the installed-candidate qualification lanes, resolve held-out corpus compatibility with the independent custodian, and prepare a new versioned RC only through the accepted process after its prerequisites pass. Exact-RC qualification, independent acceptance, and final publication remain gated by their evidence. Publication authorization remains granted and gated.\\n\\n## Current RC3 artifact and installed-candidate status (observed 2026-10-23 09:11 UTC at `1b9791f`; point-in-time snapshot)\\n\\n**Exact source gates:** `origin/main` and the signed `v1.0.0-rc.3` tag resolve to source commit `1b9791f07d301c885fe48f04a796203583ab5a5c`. Exact-main CI [39923089278](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/39923089278) and CodeQL [39923089363](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/39923089363) completed successfully on that commit. CI passed Node 22, Node 24, Linux CLI tests, security gates, requirements checks, two-build package reproducibility, SBOM validation, package smoke, and installer smoke. `node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check --tag v1.0.0-rc.3` and `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` passed at the same source; the latter reports 123 rows (108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open), with 12 explicit exact-RC qualification deferrals. This is source-gate evidence, not product acceptance.\\n\\n**RC3 artifact publication and provenance:** The annotated tag object is `dd68c222c57d0be0a4245a5b88092ff9df69201f`; its PGP signature verified good and it points to the source commit above. Release workflow [39927176480](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/39927176480) completed successfully and published the [v1.0.0-rc.3 prerelease](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc.3). The workflow-produced Linux x86-64 archive is `nexus-linux-x86_64-v1.0.0-rc.3.tar.gz`, SHA-256 `efb446d2760f2e1aa7890e9d786b8a2ba8e4ebb784fbcac1e66afe827428864d`; `SHA256SUMS` is `9288edb4655a19caa40e1598c0a642ab7f7e93aafbb187c2bfc8cfa9e19f116f`; the CycloneDX SBOM is `3a3176b4b3890c1bc07fb7b3acd80f7372f043819e6a8b296346d014b07f9d3a`. Downloaded checksums and SBOM sidecars passed. GitHub attestations for the archive and `SHA256SUMS` verified against the Release workflow, run `39927176480`, tag `v1.0.0-rc.3`, and source `1b9791f`.\\n\\n**Installed-candidate and checkpoint-choice observation:** The published installer completed with `NEXUS_VERIFY_ATTESTATION=1` and installed RC3 under `/home/mike/.local/lib/nexus/v1.0.0-rc.3`; installer provenance records the exact archive digest and source revision. `/home/mike/.local/bin/nexus --version` reports `1.0.0-rc.3 (1b9791f07d30)`. The previous RC1 directory remains installed at `/home/mike/.local/lib/nexus/v1.0.0-rc.1` for rollback. The coordinator reported an automated PTY probe of the installed default TUI using a synthetic Git workspace, fake credential-shaped canary, and unreachable loopback endpoint. The reported probe displayed the five choices and selected cancel before inference. Its transcript/capture was not retained in the release evidence tree, so this observation is unarchived and was not independently verified in the readiness review. It is diagnostic context only: it does not establish the checkpoint-choice gate, the five-environment by three-size human terminal matrix, or provider/task qualification.\\n\\n**Held-out and remaining qualification:** Public Issue #1 has no custodian response after the metadata-only request at 2026-10-23 03:46:59Z. The sealed T2 manifest remains incompatible with the current evaluator's `blackbox-v1` contract because it uses legacy `hidden.command`; the independent custodian must convert or replace it, revalidate it, and accept a new immutable manifest. No hidden task or payload was accessed and no held-out run started. Provider/standalone qualification, T2/T3/T4 including long tasks and nine fault classes, exact-RC cross-runner reproducibility, the real-terminal matrix, and independent RC acceptance remain outstanding.\\n\\n**Release disposition:** Campaign status is `NEXUS_V1_RC_QUALIFICATION_ACTIVE`; acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`. RC3 is a published candidate, not an accepted RC. No stable v1.0.0 release is claimed. The installed command now uses RC3; RC1 remains available by its versioned path. The next critical dependency is accepted held-out custody and runner compatibility; other exact-RC gates can proceed independently where their required providers and environments are available.\\n\\n## Historical readiness snapshot (observed 2026-10-23 08:14 UTC at `1b9791f`; superseded above)\\n\\n**Release source and branch reconciliation:** Release PRs #147, #153, #157, and #159 target `main`; the current release source is `origin/main@1b9791f07d301c885fe48f04a796203583ab5a5c`. `origin/v1/integration` remains at `7d6673f108316dda015b858c85b2abe20f3a4f78` from 2026-10-21 and is not the source used by the current RC3 candidate PRs. Do not combine evidence from those different heads. The shared checkout remains dirty and was not modified.\\n\\n**Source gates:** PR #159 (`a81f79df35a76207751ffd8a86640baafca98eeb`) merged as `1b9791f`. Its exact-head Node 22, Node 24, Linux package/reproducibility/install-smoke, and CodeQL checks passed; independent source review accepted the change. The focused Doctor schema-2 empty-history regression passed 1/1 with isolated HOME. At exact post-merge source `1b9791f`, `node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check` passes with all components at `1.0.0-rc.3`; `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` passes with 123 rows (108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open) and 12 explicit exact-RC qualification deferrals. Post-merge CI run [39923089278](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/39923089278) and CodeQL run [39923089363](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/39923089363) are running on the exact merge commit; do not claim post-merge CI complete until both terminate successfully.\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1789b-d3a0-7dd1-894e-ea6b5edaaa62","create_time":1793025149.9482324}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
