{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T14:34:03.154Z","ordinal":390316,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a1789b-d3a0-7dd1-894e-ea6b5edaaa62","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-7dce4957-91a9-418f-abb7-b570ea160dd8","process_id":"75190","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","sed -n '1,30p' docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-wt/readiness-rc8-install-terminal-20261026","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"read","cmd":"sed -n '1,30p' docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md","name":"READINESS.md","path":"docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"# v1.0.0 release readiness checkpoint\n\n## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-26 08:05 UTC)\n\n**Authoritative source and source gates:** `origin/main` is `bbafae868939084ccd49f21621695dff6b05f752`. Exact-main CI run [40279197785](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40279197785) completed successfully on this commit; all three required jobs (`test-matrix (22)`, `test-matrix (24)`, and `linux-x86_64`) passed. CodeQL run [40279197561](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40279197561) passed. The requirements enforcement and version synchronization checks passed on the same source: 123 requirements (108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 12 remain explicitly deferred to exact-RC qualification), with package components at `1.0.0-rc.8`.\n\n**RC8 construction and reproducibility:** Public prerelease [v1.0.0-rc.8](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc.8) was published at 07:26 UTC and resolves to the exact source commit above. Its Linux archive has GitHub asset digest `sha256:bbded963a9bcaa9c0764b86d900f752c46ed364bfe30cc67e5bbf23b5fb5f48e`. Cross-runner RC reproducibility workflow [40286712425](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40286712425) completed successfully against that exact tag, including Ubuntu 22.04 and 24.04 builds and artifact comparison. An installed RC8 copy was also provenance-verified on the Ubuntu desktop in an isolated qualification prefix ([setup record](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/3#issuecomment-6411066559)); this was not the user's normal Nexus installation and is not full installed-RC acceptance. The tag's local GPG signature verifies, but GitHub reports it as unverified (`bad_email`); the stable tag must use a signer identity that GitHub verifies against the signing key. The earlier RC6-to-RC7 upgrade attempt failed because RC6 rejected GitHub's signed release-asset redirect. The redirect allowlist and URL-secret redaction are present in RC8; the RC6 installation was not changed by the isolated RC8 check.\n\n**Acceptance blockers:** Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains OPEN; the custodian has not responded to the metadata-only request, and private custody acceptance, evaluator compatibility and sealing are not established. Held-out qualification has not started. Exact-RC provider/standalone qualification, T2/T3 and nine-class T4 qualification, and independent RC acceptance remain incomplete. The human terminal matrix remains 0/15; automated PTY checks do not satisfy it. Stable `v1.0.0` is not published. Campaign status remains `NEXUS_V1_CONVERGENCE_ACTIVE`; acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`; publication authorization remains granted but gated on acceptance.\n\nThe 06:24 checkpoint immediately below is retained as a historical snapshot; this update supersedes its CI conclusion, RC publication state, cross-runner status, and current blocker summary.\n\n## Historical checkpoint (observed 2026-10-26 06:24 UTC at `bbafae868939084ccd49f21621695dff6b05f752`)\n\n**Authoritative source and source gates:** `origin/main` is `bbafae868939084ccd49f21621695dff6b05f752`, incorporating PR #249 (`8e562b0f3406e94003806746cb69a5258f72a59f`) and PR #250. PR #249 merged at 05:57 UTC and PR #250 merged at 06:20 UTC. On this exact source, `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` passed with 123 rows (108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 12 requirements explicitly deferred to exact-RC qualification), and `node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check` confirms all components are `1.0.0-rc.8`. CodeQL run [40279197561](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40279197561) passed. Exact-main CI [40279197785](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40279197785) is still running; its Node 22 and Node 24 jobs passed Rust tests and release builds and were running the CLI test suite at 06:24 UTC. The current checkpoint does not claim full CI success.\n\n**RC and publication state:** The latest public prerelease remains `v1.0.0-rc.7`; `v1.0.0-rc.8` is not yet tagged or published. No stable `v1.0.0` release exists. The `rc.8` source version is not itself evidence of an accepted or installed RC. No release artifact should be published until every required acceptance gate passes.\n\n**Acceptance blockers:** Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1), for held-out T2/T3 corpus custody, remains OPEN (last observed update 02:33:48 UTC); the required custodian sealing and independent private-custody acceptance are not established. Held-out qualification has not started. Provider/standalone coverage, T3/T4 qualification, installed exact-RC qualification, independent RC acceptance, and the human terminal matrix (0/15 at last evidence) remain incomplete. Treat the older entries below as historical snapshots; they do not supersede these current observations.\n\n\n## Historical checkpoint (observed 2026-10-26 02:27 UTC at `62e541c9e170a51d02420753f0807c14d65d7074`)\n\n**Authoritative source and CI:** `origin/main` remains `62e541c9e170a51d02420753f0807c14d65d7074`. CI run [40255529634](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40255529634) and CodeQL run [40255529667](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40255529667) both completed successfully on that exact commit. CI passed the Node 22/24 and Linux test matrices, requirements enforcement, security gates, package build and reproducibility, SBOM checks, and package/install smoke checks.\n\n**PR #246 / `agent.ts`:** PR [#246](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/246) has been updated onto current `main`; its exact head is `2351e57ace040a48e9ff082d285a5d7edc8ed385`, based on `62e541c9e170a51d02420753f0807c14d65d7074`. `KimiCode-defect-scan` retains the `FILE_cli_src_agent.ts` claim. The implementation patch hash remains identical to the previously independently accepted diff (`d2d17c7c36072a0c310e998d67df69821007a2085990f84ca9342556610df853`). Exact-head CodeQL and JavaScript/TypeScript checks pass; CI run [40259036321](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40259036321) has Node 22 and Node 24 jobs still running. No merge has occurred; require those checks to finish successfully before integration.\n\n**Release state:** RC7 remains the latest public qualification prerelease and does not include PR #243 or subsequent main changes. Held-out qualification, provider/standalone coverage, T3/T4, human terminal evidence, and independent RC acceptance remain incomplete. Stable v1.0.0 has not been published; publication authority remains granted but gated by acceptance.\n\nThe 02:24 checkpoint below is retained as a historical snapshot and is superseded by this exact-head update.\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":731176669}},"started_at_ms":1793025242422,"completed_at_ms":1793025243154}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T14:34:04.248Z","ordinal":390317,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a178a1-fc58-7e31-908e-c77749ae2c98","call_id":"call_fa41094638c2494a8221852522534f7f","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 2.9 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"d84d89\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.731313947,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":1696,\"output\":\"Warning: truncated output (original token count: 1696)\\nTotal output lines: 30\\n\\n# v1.0.0 release readiness checkpoint\\n\\n## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-26 08:05 UTC)\\n\\n**Authoritative source and source gates:** `origin/main` is `bbafae868939084ccd49f21621695dff6b05f752`. Exact-main CI run [40279197785](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40279197785) completed successfully on this commit; all three required jobs (`test-matrix (22)`, `test-matrix (24)`, and `linux-x86_64`) passed. CodeQL run [40279197561](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40279197561) passed. The requirements enforcement and version synchronization checks passed on the same source: 123 requirements (108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 12 remain explicitly deferred to exact-RC qualification), with package components at `1.0.0-rc.8`.\\n\\n**RC8 construction and reproducibility:** Public prerelease [v1.0.0-rc.8](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc.8) was published at 07:26 UTC and resolves to the exact source commit above. Its Linux archive has GitHub asset digest `sha256:bbded963a9bcaa9c0764b86d900f752c46ed364bfe30cc67e5bbf23b5fb5f48e`. Cross-runner RC reproducibility workflow [40286712425](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40286712425) completed successfully against that exact tag, including Ubuntu 22.04 and 24.04 builds and artifact comparison. An installed RC8 copy was also provenance-verified on the Ubuntu desktop in an isolated qualification prefix ([setup record](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/3#issuecomment-6411066559)); this was not the user's normal Nexus installation and is not full installed-RC acceptance. The tag's local GPG signature verifies, but GitHub reports it as unverified (`bad_email`); the stable tag must use a signer identity that GitHub verifies against the signing key. The earlier RC6-to-RC7 upgrade attempt failed because RC6 rejected GitHub's signed release-asset redirect. The redirect allowlist and URL-secret redaction are present in RC8; the RC6 installation was not changed by the isolated RC8 check.\\n\\n**Acceptance blockers:** Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains OPEN; the custodian has not responded to the metadata-only request, and private custody acceptance, evaluator compatibility and sealing are not established. Held-out qualification has not started. Exact-RC provider/standalone qualification, T2/T3 and nine-class T4 qualification, and independent RC acceptance remain incomplete. The human terminal matrix remains 0/15; automated PTY checks do not satisfy it. Stable `v1.0.0` is not published. Campaign status remains `NEXUS_V1_CONVERGENCE_ACTIVE`; acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`; publication authorization remains granted but gated on acceptance.\\n\\nThe 06:24 checkpoint immediately below is retained as a historical snapshot; this update supersedes its CI conclusion, RC publication state, cross-runner status, and current blocker summary.\\n\\n## Historical checkpoint (observed 2026-10-26 06:24 UTC at `bbafae868939084ccd49f21621695dff6b05f752`)\\n\\n**Authoritative source and source gates:** `origin/main` is `bbafae868939084ccd49f21621695dff6b05f752`, incorporating PR …96 tokens truncated…omponents are `1.0.0-rc.8`. CodeQL run [40279197561](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40279197561) passed. Exact-main CI [40279197785](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40279197785) is still running; its Node 22 and Node 24 jobs passed Rust tests and release builds and were running the CLI test suite at 06:24 UTC. The current checkpoint does not claim full CI success.\\n\\n**RC and publication state:** The latest public prerelease remains `v1.0.0-rc.7`; `v1.0.0-rc.8` is not yet tagged or published. No stable `v1.0.0` release exists. The `rc.8` source version is not itself evidence of an accepted or installed RC. No release artifact should be published until every required acceptance gate passes.\\n\\n**Acceptance blockers:** Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1), for held-out T2/T3 corpus custody, remains OPEN (last observed update 02:33:48 UTC); the required custodian sealing and independent private-custody acceptance are not established. Held-out qualification has not started. Provider/standalone coverage, T3/T4 qualification, installed exact-RC qualification, independent RC acceptance, and the human terminal matrix (0/15 at last evidence) remain incomplete. Treat the older entries below as historical snapshots; they do not supersede these current observations.\\n\\n\\n## Historical checkpoint (observed 2026-10-26 02:27 UTC at `62e541c9e170a51d02420753f0807c14d65d7074`)\\n\\n**Authoritative source and CI:** `origin/main` remains `62e541c9e170a51d02420753f0807c14d65d7074`. CI run [40255529634](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40255529634) and CodeQL run [40255529667](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40255529667) both completed successfully on that exact commit. CI passed the Node 22/24 and Linux test matrices, requirements enforcement, security gates, package build and reproducibility, SBOM checks, and package/install smoke checks.\\n\\n**PR #246 / `agent.ts`:** PR [#246](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/246) has been updated onto current `main`; its exact head is `2351e57ace040a48e9ff082d285a5d7edc8ed385`, based on `62e541c9e170a51d02420753f0807c14d65d7074`. `KimiCode-defect-scan` retains the `FILE_cli_src_agent.ts` claim. The implementation patch hash remains identical to the previously independently accepted diff (`d2d17c7c36072a0c310e998d67df69821007a2085990f84ca9342556610df853`). Exact-head CodeQL and JavaScript/TypeScript checks pass; CI run [40259036321](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40259036321) has Node 22 and Node 24 jobs still running. No merge has occurred; require those checks to finish successfully before integration.\\n\\n**Release state:** RC7 remains the latest public qualification prerelease and does not include PR #243 or subsequent main changes. Held-out qualification, provider/standalone coverage, T3/T4, human terminal evidence, and independent RC acceptance remain incomplete. Stable v1.0.0 has not been published; publication authority remains granted but gated by acceptance.\\n\\nThe 02:24 checkpoint below is retained as a historical snapshot and is superseded by this exact-head update.\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1789b-d3a0-7dd1-894e-ea6b5edaaa62","create_time":1793025244.2480826}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
