{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T14:34:56.338Z","ordinal":390358,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a1789b-d3a0-7dd1-894e-ea6b5edaaa62","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-dea9b047-e97d-47cd-ab53-d8fd3e04a874","process_id":"74421","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","sed -n '1,16p' docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-wt/readiness-rc8-install-terminal-20261026","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"read","cmd":"sed -n '1,16p' docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md","name":"READINESS.md","path":"docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"# v1.0.0 release readiness checkpoint\n\n## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-26 13:45 UTC)\n\n**Authoritative source and source gates:** `origin/main` is `b73b6ecaf753ff3eba8d5e1930ede7a471359421`, integrating PR #252 (`7f52ed1b76e2fa69dee1416d1b13f1e1263ff52d`) and PR #254 (`b73b6ecaf753ff3eba8d5e1930ede7a471359421`). Exact-main CI run [40327501470](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40327501470) and CodeQL runs [40327501389](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40327501389) and [40331254134](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40331254134) passed on this source. The release requirements enforcement (123 rows; 12 explicitly deferred to exact-RC qualification) and version synchronization checks passed; synchronized components remain `1.0.0-rc.8`.\n\n**Candidate and publication state:** Public prerelease [v1.0.0-rc.8](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc.8) remains the latest release, but its tag resolves to `bbafae868939084ccd49f21621695dff6b05f752`, before PR #252 and PR #254. Its Linux archive digest remains `sha256:bbded963a9bcaa9c0764b86d900f752c46ed364bfe30cc67e5bbf23b5fb5f48e`. RC8 reproducibility and isolated-prefix provenance checks apply only to that earlier artifact. It is not an accepted RC for current `main`; a candidate from the current source must be rebuilt and qualified. No stable `v1.0.0` release exists. The RC8 signing identity remains reported by GitHub as unverified (`bad_email`); stable signing must use a GitHub-verified identity.\n\n**Acceptance blockers:** Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains open. The latest public metadata-only custody request (12:18 UTC) has no custodian response; do not access held-out payloads or begin the held-out run before independent custody acceptance. The last recorded human terminal matrix is 0/15, with real-terminal operator evidence still required. Exact-current-RC installed qualification, standalone/provider acceptance, T2/T3/T4 qualification and independent exact-RC acceptance are not established. Acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`; publication authorization remains granted but gated on all required acceptance and stable-artifact checks.\n\nThe 08:05 checkpoint immediately below is retained as historical evidence; this update supersedes its source, CI, candidate and current blocker status.\n\n## Historical checkpoint (observed 2026-10-26 08:05 UTC)\n\n**Authoritative source and source gates:** `origin/main` is `bbafae868939084ccd49f21621695dff6b05f752`. Exact-main CI run [40279197785](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40279197785) completed successfully on this commit; all three required jobs (`test-matrix (22)`, `test-matrix (24)`, and `linux-x86_64`) passed. CodeQL run [40279197561](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40279197561) passed. The requirements enforcement and version synchronization checks passed on the same source: 123 requirements (108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 12 remain explicitly deferred to exact-RC qualification), with package components at `1.0.0-rc.8`.\n\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":750891406}},"started_at_ms":1793025295586,"completed_at_ms":1793025296337}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T14:34:57.534Z","ordinal":390359,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a178a2-cc7e-7f70-8654-2973a1a62d1d","call_id":"call_e94f9066b8394771b628137a1f00cb93","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 3.1 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"2da87e\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.750926297,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":793,\"output\":\"# v1.0.0 release readiness checkpoint\\n\\n## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-26 13:45 UTC)\\n\\n**Authoritative source and source gates:** `origin/main` is `b73b6ecaf753ff3eba8d5e1930ede7a471359421`, integrating PR #252 (`7f52ed1b76e2fa69dee1416d1b13f1e1263ff52d`) and PR #254 (`b73b6ecaf753ff3eba8d5e1930ede7a471359421`). Exact-main CI run [40327501470](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40327501470) and CodeQL runs [40327501389](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40327501389) and [40331254134](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40331254134) passed on this source. The release requirements enforcement (123 rows; 12 explicitly deferred to exact-RC qualification) and version synchronization checks passed; synchronized components remain `1.0.0-rc.8`.\\n\\n**Candidate and publication state:** Public prerelease [v1.0.0-rc.8](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc.8) remains the latest release, but its tag resolves to `bbafae868939084ccd49f21621695dff6b05f752`, before PR #252 and PR #254. Its Linux archive digest remains `sha256:bbded963a9bcaa9c0764b86d900f752c46ed364bfe30cc67e5bbf23b5fb5f48e`. RC8 reproducibility and isolated-prefix provenance checks apply only to that earlier artifact. It is not an accepted RC for current `main`; a candidate from the current source must be rebuilt and qualified. No stable `v1.0.0` release exists. The RC8 signing identity remains reported by GitHub as unverified (`bad_email`); stable signing must use a GitHub-verified identity.\\n\\n**Acceptance blockers:** Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains open. The latest public metadata-only custody request (12:18 UTC) has no custodian response; do not access held-out payloads or begin the held-out run before independent custody acceptance. The last recorded human terminal matrix is 0/15, with real-terminal operator evidence still required. Exact-current-RC installed qualification, standalone/provider acceptance, T2/T3/T4 qualification and independent exact-RC acceptance are not established. Acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`; publication authorization remains granted but gated on all required acceptance and stable-artifact checks.\\n\\nThe 08:05 checkpoint immediately below is retained as historical evidence; this update supersedes its source, CI, candidate and current blocker status.\\n\\n## Historical checkpoint (observed 2026-10-26 08:05 UTC)\\n\\n**Authoritative source and source gates:** `origin/main` is `bbafae868939084ccd49f21621695dff6b05f752`. Exact-main CI run [40279197785](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40279197785) completed successfully on this commit; all three required jobs (`test-matrix (22)`, `test-matrix (24)`, and `linux-x86_64`) passed. CodeQL run [40279197561](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40279197561) passed. The requirements enforcement and version synchronization checks passed on the same source: 123 requirements (108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 12 remain explicitly deferred to exact-RC qualification), with package components at `1.0.0-rc.8`.\\n\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1789b-d3a0-7dd1-894e-ea6b5edaaa62","create_time":1793025297.5346751}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
