{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T14:40:31.188Z","ordinal":390589,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a1789b-d3a0-7dd1-894e-ea6b5edaaa62","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adf665de9d481a0a7be535b282b500e","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The attached error identifies the failure point: the RC6 updater rejects GitHub’s signed release-asset download URL before it can download RC7. I’ll keep the signed link private and check the current updater fix and release evidence. The separate readiness review also found one status line to correct before that change can be reviewed again.\n\nThe project memory service is also unavailable right now: “Claude rejected the request because its five-hour usage allowance is exhausted.” I’ll continue from the verified work state in this session."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1793025629945,"completed_at_ms":1793025631188}}
