\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40338957629/job/121628040574\"},{\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-26T14:39:55Z\",\"conclusion\":\"failure\",\"databaseId\":121628041011,\"name\":\"test-matrix (22)\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-26T14:21:56Z\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"steps\":[{\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-26T14:21:58Z\",\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"Set up job\",\"number\":1,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-26T14:21:57Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-26T14:22:00Z\",\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"Run actions/checkout@11d5960a326750d5838078e36cf38b85af677262\",\"number\":2,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-26T14:21:58Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-26T14:23:09Z\",\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"Run sudo apt-get update && sudo apt-get install --yes acl make bubblewrap build-essential meson ninja-build pkg-config libcap-dev\",\"number\":3,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-26T14:22:00Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-26T14:23:16Z\",\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"Run actions/setup-go@40f1582b2485089dde7abd97c1529aa768e1baff\",\"number\":4,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-26T14:23:09Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-26T14:23:18Z\",\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"Run bash scripts/ensure-ci-bubblewrap.sh\",\"number\":5,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-26T14:23:16Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-26T14:23:18Z\",\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"Run bash scripts/ensure-ci-user-cgroups.sh\",\"number\":6,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-26T14:23:18Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-26T14:23:18Z\",\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"Mount a dedicated capped tmpfs for evaluator resource fixtures\",\"number\":7,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-26T14:23:18Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-26T14:23:20Z\",\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"Run actions/setup-node@49933ea5288caeca8642d1e84afbd3f7d6820020\",\"number\":8,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-26T14:23:18Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-26T14:23:23Z\",\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"Install selected Node runtime for isolated evaluation commands\",\"number\":9,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-26T14:23:20Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-26T14:23:23Z\",\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"Run node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check\",\"number\":10,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-26T14:23:23Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-26T14:23:23Z\",\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"Run node scripts/check_requirements.mjs\",\"number\":11,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-26T14:23:23Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-26T14:23:24Z\",\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"Run npm ci --prefix cli\",\"number\":12,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-26T14:23:23Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-26T14:23:29Z\",\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"Run npm --prefix cli run build\",\"number\":13,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-26T14:23:24Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-26T14:23:29Z\",\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"Run git diff --exit-code -- cli/dist\",\"number\":14,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-26T14:23:29Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-26T14:24:26Z\",\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"Run cargo test --locked --manifest-path core/Cargo.toml\",\"number\":15,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-26T14:23:29Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-26T14:25:32Z\",\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"Run cargo build --locked --release --manifest-path core/Cargo.toml --bin harness-core --bin nexus-tui\",\"number\":16,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-26T14:24:26Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-26T14:25:33Z\",\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"Install pinned security and SBOM test tools\",\"number\":17,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-26T14:25:32Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-26T14:39:51Z\",\"conclusion\":\"failure\",\"name\":\"Run npm --prefix cli test\",\"number\":18,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-26T14:25:33Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-26T14:39:51Z\",\"conclusion\":\"skipped\",\"name\":\"Post Run actions/setup-node@49933ea5288caeca8642d1e84afbd3f7d6820020\",\"number\":34,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-26T14:39:51Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-26T14:39:51Z\",\"conclusion\":\"skipped\",\"name\":\"Post Run actions/setup-go@40f1582b2485089dde7abd97c1529aa768e1baff\",\"number\":35,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-26T14:39:51Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-26T14:39:51Z\",\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"Post Run actions/checkout@11d5960a326750d5838078e36cf38b85af677262\",\"number\":36,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-26T14:39:51Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-26T14:39:51Z\",\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"Complete job\",\"number\":37,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-26T14:39:51Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"}],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40338957629/job/121628041011\"},{\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-26T14:39:55Z\",\"conclusion\":\"skipped\",\"databaseId\":121637870224,\"name\":\"linux-x86_64\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-26T14:39:55Z\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"steps\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40338957629/job/121637870224\"}],\"status\":\"completed\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40338957629\"}\n# v1.0.0 release readiness checkpoint\n\n## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-26 14:35 UTC)\n\n**Authoritative source and source gates:** origin/main is ff349383537b10ec6198ceb0961e833bd519c2b4, the merge commit for PR #255. PR #255's exact-head Node 22, Node 24, Linux packaging, CodeQL, and JavaScript/TypeScript checks passed. Post-merge CI run [40340228722](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40340228722) is still running Node 22/24 on ff349383; post-merge CodeQL [40340228417](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40340228417) passed. On the exact ff349383 worktree, requirements enforcement passed: 123 rows (108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open), with 12 rows explicitly deferred to exact-RC qualification. node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check passed; components remain 1.0.0-rc.8. Do not treat post-merge CI as complete until run 40340228722 terminates successfully.\n\n**RC8 upgrade diagnosis and installed artifact:** The attempted RC6-to-RC7 upgrade failed because RC7's updater rejects GitHub's signed release-asset redirect; its error also included the full signed URL. The published RC8 source and packaged upgrade.js accept HTTPS only for the restricted GitHub release-asset path and report only the origin on errors. On the local mike-dev installation, nexus --version reports 1.0.0-rc.8 (bbafae868939) under isolated HOME; the installed package manifest passes, and its recorded archive digest matches the published RC8 Linux archive digest sha256:bbded963a9bcaa9c0764b86d900f752c46ed364bfe30cc67e5bbf23b5fb5f48e. The downloaded archive and SHA256SUMS both passed gh attestation verify; the archive checksum matched the release index. A synthetic runtime probe of the installed RC8 validator accepted the release-asset path and rejected a generic path and HTTP. These checks establish the RC8 fix and this install's integrity; they are not a qualification run. RC8 remains based on bbafae868939084ccd49f21621695dff6b05f752, before current main, so it is not the exact candidate for current-source acceptance.\n\n**Terminal environment preparation:** A strict known-host SSH connection to the configured Ubuntu/GNOME desktop succeeded. Read-only inventory found xterm 407, kitty 0.45.0, GNOME Terminal 3.58.0, tmux 3.6, and VS Code 1.143.1; an active GNOME Wayland session is present. This is environment availability only. No manual terminal cell was run, no screenshot was captured, and the §5.3 matrix remains **0/15**. It still requires each of the five terminals at 80×24, 40×14, and 200×60, with approval-panel and post-exit screenshots for every cell and genuine operator verdicts.\n\n**Acceptance and remaining gates:** Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains open; the latest public metadata-only custody request at 12:18 UTC has no custodian response. Private custody acceptance and evaluator-compatible sealed corpus readiness remain unestablished; no held-out payload was accessed or run. PR [#256](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/256) remains open at c3bb2235, based on b73b6ec; it needs refresh onto ff349383 after remediation. Exact-head CI run 40338957629 is still running Node 22/24 and CodeQL 40338957381 passed on the old candidate. A local, unpushed commit 8655ca87 fixes request-correlated local-setup cancellation (focused Node 34/34, Rust 4/4, build and diff checks passed), but the independent rereview recorded other unresolved credential/configuration findings; it is not integrated or accepted. T2/T3/T4, current-candidate provider and standalone qualification, exact-candidate reproducibility, the manual terminal matrix, and independent exact-RC acceptance remain incomplete. Acceptance remains IN_PROGRESS; no stable v1.0.0 release exists. Publication authority remains granted and gated by acceptance.\n\nThe 13:45 checkpoint below remains as historical evidence; this update supersedes its origin/main, post-merge CI, installed-version, terminal-environment, and current blocker observations.\n\n## Historical checkpoint (observed 2026-10-26 13:45 UTC)\n\n**Authoritative source and source gates:** `origin/main` is `b73b6ecaf753ff3eba8d5e1930ede7a471359421`, integrating PR #252 (`7f52ed1b76e2fa69dee1416d1b13f1e1263ff52d`) and PR #254 (`b73b6ecaf753ff3eba8d5e1930ede7a471359421`). Exact-main CI run [40327501470](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40327501470) and CodeQL runs [40327501389](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40327501389) and [40331254134](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40331254134) passed on this source. The release requirements enforcement (123 rows; 12 explicitly deferred to exact-RC qualification) and version synchronization checks passed; synchronized components remain `1.0.0-rc.8`.\n\n**Candidate and publication state:** Public prerelease [v1.0.0-rc.8](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc.8) remains the latest release, but its tag resolves to `bbafae868939084ccd49f21621695dff6b05f752`, before PR #252 and PR #254. Its Linux archive digest remains `sha256:bbded963a9bcaa9c0764b86d900f752c46ed364bfe30cc67e5bbf23b5fb5f48e`. RC8 reproducibility and isolated-prefix provenance checks apply only to that earlier artifact. It is not an accepted RC for current `main`; a candidate from the current source must be rebuilt and qualified. No stable `v1.0.0` release exists. The RC8 signing identity remains reported by GitHub as unverified (`bad_email`); stable signing must use a GitHub-verified identity.\n\n**Acceptance blockers:** Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains open. The latest public metadata-only custody request (12:18 UTC) has no custodian response; do not access held-out payloads or begin the held-out run before independent custody acceptance. The last recorded human terminal matrix is 0/15, with real-terminal operator evidence still required. Exact-current-RC installed qualification, standalone/provider acceptance, T2/T3/T4 qualification and independent exact-RC acceptance are not established. Acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`; publication authorization remains granted but gated on all required acceptance and stable-artifact checks.\n\nThe 08:05 checkpoint immediately below is retained as historical evidence; this update supersedes its source, CI, candidate and current blocker status.\n\n## Historical checkpoint (observed 2026-10-26 08:05 UTC)\n\n**Authoritative source and source gates:** `origin/main` is `bbafae868939084ccd49f21621695dff6b05f752`. Exact-main CI run [40279197785](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40279197785) completed successfully on this commit; all three required jobs (`test-matrix (22)`, `test-matrix (24)`, and `linux-x86_64`) passed. CodeQL run [40279197561](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40279197561) passed. The requirements enforcement and version synchronization checks passed on the same source: 123 requirements (108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 12 remain explicitly deferred to exact-RC qualification), with package components at `1.0.0-rc.8`.\n\n**RC8 construction and reproducibility:** Public prerelease [v1.0.0-rc.8](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc.8) was published at 07:26 UTC and resolves to the exact source commit above. Its Linux archive has GitHub asset digest `sha256:bbded963a9bcaa9c0764b86d900f752c46ed364bfe30cc67e5bbf23b5fb5f48e`. Cross-runner RC reproducibility workflow [40286712425](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40286712425) completed successfully against that exact tag, including Ubuntu 22.04 and 24.04 builds and artifact comparison. An installed RC8 copy was also provenance-verified on the Ubuntu desktop in an isolated qualification prefix ([setup record](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/3#issuecomment-6411066559)); this was not the user's normal Nexus installation and is not full installed-RC acceptance. The tag's local GPG signature verifies, but GitHub reports it as unverified (`bad_email`); the stable tag must use a signer identity that GitHub verifies against the signing key. The earlier RC6-to-RC7 upgrade attempt failed because RC6 rejected GitHub's signed release-asset redirect. The redirect allowlist and URL-secret redaction are present in RC8; the RC6 installation was not changed by the isolated RC8 check.\n\n**Acceptance blockers:** Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains OPEN; the custodian has not responded to the metadata-only request, and private custody acceptance, evaluator compatibility and sealing are not established. Held-out qualification has not started. Exact-RC provider/standalone qualification, T2/T3 and nine-class T4 qualification, and independent RC acceptance remain incomplete. The human terminal matrix remains 0/15; automated PTY checks do not satisfy it. Stable `v1.0.0` is not published. Campaign status remains `NEXUS_V1_CONVERGENCE_ACTIVE`; acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`; publication authorization remains granted but gated on acceptance.\n\nThe 06:24 checkpoint immediately below is retained as a historical snapshot; this update supersedes its CI conclusion, RC publication state, cross-runner status, and current blocker summary.\n\n## Historical checkpoint (observed 2026-10-26 06:24 UTC at `bbafae868939084ccd49f21621695dff6b05f752`)\n\n**Authoritative source and source gates:** `origin/main` is `bbafae868939084ccd49f21621695dff6b05f752`, incorporating PR #249 (`8e562b0f3406e94003806746cb69a5258f72a59f`) and PR #250. PR #249 merged at 05:57 UTC and PR #250 merged at 06:20 UTC. On this exact source, `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` passed with 123 rows (108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 12 requirements explicitly deferred to exact-RC qualification), and `node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check` confirms all components are `1.0.0-rc.8`. CodeQL run [40279197561](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40279197561) passed. Exact-main CI [40279197785](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40279197785) is still running; its Node 22 and Node 24 jobs passed Rust tests and release builds and were running the CLI test suite at 06:24 UTC. The current checkpoint does not claim full CI success.\n\n**RC and publication state:** The latest public prerelease remains `v1.0.0-rc.7`; `v1.0.0-rc.8` is not yet tagged or published. No stable `v1.0.0` release exists. The `rc.8` source version is not itself evidence of an accepted or installed RC. No release artifact should be published until every required acceptance gate passes.\n\n**Acceptance blockers:** Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1), for held-out T2/T3 corpus custody, remains OPEN (last observed update 02:33:48 UTC); the required custodian sealing and independent private-custody acceptance are not established. Held-out qualification has not started. Provider/standalone coverage, T3/T4 qualification, installed exact-RC qualification, independent RC acceptance, and the human terminal matrix (0/15 at last evidence) remain incomplete. Treat the older entries below as historical snapshots; they do not supersede these current observations.\n\n\n## Historical checkpoint (observed 2026-10-26 02:27 UTC at `62e541c9e170a51d02420753f0807c14d65d7074`)\n\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":1,"nanos":844572630}},"started_at_ms":1793025633356,"completed_at_ms":1793025635201}}
