ator-compatible sealed corpus readiness remain unestablished; no held-out payload was accessed or run. PR [#256](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/256) remains open at c3bb2235, based on b73b6ec; it needs refresh onto ff349383 after remediation. Exact-head CI run 40338957629 is still running Node 22/24 and CodeQL 40338957381 passed on the old candidate. A local, unpushed commit 8655ca87 fixes request-correlated local-setup cancellation (focused Node 34/34, Rust 4/4, build and diff checks passed), but the independent rereview recorded other unresolved credential/configuration findings; it is not integrated or accepted. T2/T3/T4, current-candidate provider and standalone qualification, exact-candidate reproducibility, the manual terminal matrix, and independent exact-RC acceptance remain incomplete. Acceptance remains IN_PROGRESS; no stable v1.0.0 release exists. Publication authority remains granted and gated by acceptance.\n37:**Authoritative source and source gates:** `origin/main` is `bbafae868939084ccd49f21621695dff6b05f752`, incorporating PR #249 (`8e562b0f3406e94003806746cb69a5258f72a59f`) and PR #250. PR #249 merged at 05:57 UTC and PR #250 merged at 06:20 UTC. On this exact source, `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` passed with 123 rows (108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 12 requirements explicitly deferred to exact-RC qualification), and `node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check` confirms all components are `1.0.0-rc.8`. CodeQL run [40279197561](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40279197561) passed. Exact-main CI [40279197785](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40279197785) is still running; its Node 22 and Node 24 jobs passed Rust tests and release builds and were running the CLI test suite at 06:24 UTC. The current checkpoint does not claim full CI success.\n48:**PR #246 / `agent.ts`:** PR [#246](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/246) has been updated onto curre