{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T14:43:13.228Z","ordinal":390713,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"task_complete","root_turn_id":"01a1789b-d3a0-7dd1-894e-ea6b5edaaa62","turn_id":"01a1789b-d3a0-7dd1-894e-ea6b5edaaa62","last_agent_message":"The failure is at the download-origin check: RC6 rejects GitHub’s signed release-asset redirect, so the upgrade stops before downloading RC7. The signed link has expired; don’t reuse or share it.\n\nRC8 contains a restricted redirect fix, and its installed artifact was verified against the published checksum. RC8 still predates current `main`, so it is not qualified as the release candidate.\n\nI corrected the readiness record in commit `2cceda9`; the requirements and version checks pass, and independent review accepted the update. PR #256’s old Node 22 and 24 runs both failed on the same provider-setup terminal test; the owner is investigating. Current-main CI is still running. Acceptance remains **IN_PROGRESS**.","started_at":1793024840,"completed_at":1793025793,"duration_ms":952608,"time_to_first_token_ms":5196}}
