{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T14:49:05.034Z","ordinal":390914,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a178aa-5cd4-77e2-b762-b08d50983277","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adf6860449881a0bb5456493ebc5155","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The first focused validation also exposed an environment prerequisite: nine sidecar tests could not connect because this worktree lacked the `harness-core` executable. The owner is building it and rerunning only those tests. Separately, they strengthened the model-cache regression to distinguish API paths on the same host, avoiding cross-tenant cache reuse. These changes remain uncommitted and unreviewed."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1793026144344,"completed_at_ms":1793026145034}}
