lastComment\": {\n    \"author\": \"mikeholownych\",\n    \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-26T12:18:17Z\",\n    \"body\": \"Release coordinator follow-up (public metadata only; current exact source: `7f52ed1b76e2fa69dee1416d1b13f1e1263ff52d`). PR #252 is integrated; post-merge Node 22/24 jobs pass and Linux package CI is still running. Held-out qualification remains closed because independent custody has not been confirmed. Please reply with safe metadata only: 1. The currently assigned independent author and custodian, or confirmation that a formal handoff is needed.\"\n  }\n}\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":2,"nanos":852514068}},"started_at_ms":1793026619120,"completed_at_ms":1793026621973}}
