{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T14:57:07.394Z","ordinal":391144,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a178aa-5cd4-77e2-b762-b08d50983277","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adf6a425de081a0ba611316c46098d6","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"Independent review found four genuine gaps in the local-provider change, so it is not ready to integrate yet: cancellation on Escape during endpoint discovery, invalid credential-origin metadata handling, wording that implies the key is already stored, and per-provider handling of malformed model URLs. I’ve sent the owner these findings with regression-test requirements and asked them to update the branch from `ff349383` without rewriting history. Issue #1 still has no custodian response; the latest public status remains open."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1793026626390,"completed_at_ms":1793026627394}}
