{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T15:05:15.222Z","ordinal":391374,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a178be-88d5-7a52-98ae-ad664c189557","author":"/root/plan05_readonly_review","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/plan05_readonly_review\nPayload:\n**ACCEPT** — reviewed commit `abae8e5d22daaa26803c3e696006c11d861b4dad` against `2cceda9645704383004a53f3bc9210f4622b6072`.\n\nThe added checkpoint accurately records main at `ff349383`, CI run `40340228722` with Node 22/24 successful and Linux still running `npm --prefix cli test`, and CodeQL run `40340228417` successful. PR #256’s branch currently resolves to `c3bb2235286a154280f8578458a4dc8570ae542a`; its cited run `40338957629` shows both Node jobs failed at the CLI test step and Linux was skipped. The local `0490db3` candidate is clearly labeled unpushed, with its tests attributed to the pre-merge head and its outstanding review findings retained.\n\nIssue #1 is open; the latest metadata-only request is timestamped 12:18 UTC, with no custodian response. The checkpoint keeps held-out acceptance, the terminal matrix, and release acceptance explicitly incomplete. No corrections needed."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a178aa-5cd4-77e2-b762-b08d50983277","create_time":1793027115.2218966}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":19249}}
