{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T15:59:51.141Z","ordinal":392773,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a178d5-a588-7873-8790-fb703eb53a02","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adf78f6078081a08cff318eb84af7b0","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The URL is the key clue: RC7 predates the fix. Its downloader allowed `github.com` and `objects.githubusercontent.com`, but rejected GitHub’s newer signed `release-assets.githubusercontent.com` redirect; RC7 also printed the full signed URL in its error. RC8’s source contains a narrow path allowlist for that host and redacts query strings. I’m checking the published RC8 artifact and its targeted regression evidence before recommending the recovery path."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1793030390053,"completed_at_ms":1793030391141}}
