{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T16:22:39.869Z","ordinal":393353,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a178fa-f0ed-7ab3-bb71-477460bd1a0a","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-637716c6-8c02-4109-9b4a-45629a16e4f4","process_id":"63473","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","gh pr view 258 --json title,body,author,assignees,reviewRequests --jq '{title,author:.author.login,assignees:[.assignees[].login],reviewRequests:[.reviewRequests[].login],body}'"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"gh pr view 258 --json title,body,author,assignees,reviewRequests --jq '{title,author:.author.login,assignees:[.assignees[].login],reviewRequests:[.reviewRequests[].login],body}'"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"{\"assignees\":[],\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"## Summary\\n\\n- Preserve an explicit `LOCAL_LLM_CREDENTIAL_ORIGIN` when resolving an operator-provided legacy key, so changing the selected local endpoint cannot rebind that key.\\n- Extend the endpoint-change regression through `buildConfig()` and an actual outbound `/models` request; the new endpoint must receive only `Bearer not-needed`.\\n- Update the RC9 release notes to include the integrated local endpoint setup flow and credential-origin behavior.\\n\\n## Evidence\\n\\n- Baseline regression on exact main `33f7685e6e333b7a3d30cb15498357f7cd45dd4c` fails: `environmentCredential()` reports the replacement endpoint instead of recorded origin `http://127.0.0.1:4321`.\\n- `node scripts/run_tests.mjs test/provider_connect.test.ts` — 33/33 passed on this branch with isolated HOME/XDG.\\n- `tsc --noEmit` — passed.\\n- `git diff --check` — passed.\\n- Independent read-only review — ACCEPT for exact diff SHA-256 `1e7a8414b112d895345b14a7e27b9d7769428df6c904cde09ff8ef0f23061fe1`.\\n- Synthetic credentials only; no real provider contacted.\\n\\nHosted exact-head CI/CodeQL are pending. The fix does not establish RC acceptance or stable-release readiness.\\n\",\"reviewRequests\":[],\"title\":\"fix: keep local credentials bound to their origin\"}\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":392484157}},"started_at_ms":1793031759476,"completed_at_ms":1793031759869}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T16:22:40.884Z","ordinal":393354,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a17905-6bf4-7eb1-941b-0ee5f701a478","call_id":"call_13eeced3dda14bcca5e8c32dae4ff099","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 2.5 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"assignees\":[],\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"## Summary\\n\\n- Preserve an explicit `LOCAL_LLM_CREDENTIAL_ORIGIN` when resolving an operator-provided legacy key, so changing the selected local endpoint cannot rebind that key.\\n- Extend the endpoint-change regression through `buildConfig()` and an actual outbound `/models` request; the new endpoint must receive only `Bearer not-needed`.\\n- Update the RC9 release notes to include the integrated local endpoint setup flow and credential-origin behavior.\\n\\n## Evidence\\n\\n- Baseline regression on exact main `33f7685e6e333b7a3d30cb15498357f7cd45dd4c` fails: `environmentCredential()` reports the replacement endpoint instead of recorded origin `http://127.0.0.1:4321`.\\n- `node scripts/run_tests.mjs test/provider_connect.test.ts` — 33/33 passed on this branch with isolated HOME/XDG.\\n- `tsc --noEmit` — passed.\\n- `git diff --check` — passed.\\n- Independent read-only review — ACCEPT for exact diff SHA-256 `1e7a8414b112d895345b14a7e27b9d7769428df6c904cde09ff8ef0f23061fe1`.\\n- Synthetic credentials only; no real provider contacted.\\n\\nHosted exact-head CI/CodeQL are pending. The fix does not establish RC acceptance or stable-release readiness.\\n\",\"reviewRequests\":[],\"title\":\"fix: keep local credentials bound to their origin\"}\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a178fa-f0ed-7ab3-bb71-477460bd1a0a","create_time":1793031760.8842497}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
