{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T17:38:56.264Z","ordinal":394667,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a1794b-3c88-7572-a066-3c59010f97d3","call_id":"call_8b85e7363bca4e7f8e9f480ad5583ad7","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 2.2 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"Warning: truncated output (original token count: 2639)\nTotal output lines: 50\n\n{\"agent\":\"codex-root\",\"host\":\"mike-dev\",\"branch\":\"v1/readiness-rc8-install-terminal-20261026\",\"base\":\"ff349383537b10ec6198ceb0961e833bd519c2b4\",\"since\":\"2026-10-26T14:33:31Z\",\"scope\":\"append a current evidence checkpoint to docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md only; record RC8 installed artifact integrity/upgrade diagnosis and Ubuntu terminal environment inventory; preserve all earlier history; do not claim qualification\"}\n# v1.0.0 release readiness checkpoint\n\n## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-26 13:45 UTC)\n\n**Authoritative source and source gates:** `origin/main` is `b73b6ecaf753ff3eba8d5e1930ede7a471359421`, integrating PR #252 (`7f52ed1b76e2fa69dee1416d1b13f1e1263ff52d`) and PR #254 (`b73b6ecaf753ff3eba8d5e1930ede7a471359421`). Exact-main CI run [40327501470](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40327501470) and CodeQL runs [40327501389](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40327501389) and [40331254134](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40331254134) passed on this source. The release requirements enforcement (123 rows; 12 explicitly deferred to exact-RC qualification) and version synchronization checks passed; synchronized components remain `1.0.0-rc.8`.\n\n**Candidate and publication state:** Public prerelease [v1.0.0-rc.8](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc.8) remains the latest release, but its tag resolves to `bbafae868939084ccd49f21621695dff6b05f752`, before PR #252 and PR #254. Its Linux archive digest remains `sha256:bbded963a9bcaa9c0764b86d900f752c46ed364bfe30cc67e5bbf23b5fb5f48e`. RC8 reproducibility and isolated-prefix provenance checks apply only to that earlier artifact. It is not an accepted RC for current `main`; a candidate from the current source must be rebuilt and qualified. No stable `v1.0.0` release exists. The RC8 signing identity remains reported by GitHub as unverified (`bad_email`); stable signing must use a GitHub-verified identity.\n\n**Accepta…1639 tokens truncated…02420753f0807c14d65d7074`. `KimiCode-defect-scan` retains the `FILE_cli_src_agent.ts` claim. The implementation patch hash remains identical to the previously independently accepted diff (`d2d17c7c36072a0c310e998d67df69821007a2085990f84ca9342556610df853`). Exact-head CodeQL and JavaScript/TypeScript checks pass; CI run [40259036321](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40259036321) has Node 22 and Node 24 jobs still running. No merge has occurred; require those checks to finish successfully before integration.\n\n**Release state:** RC7 remains the latest public qualification prerelease and does not include PR #243 or subsequent main changes. Held-out qualification, provider/standalone coverage, T3/T4, human terminal evidence, and independent RC acceptance remain incomplete. Stable v1.0.0 has not been published; publication authority remains granted but gated by acceptance.\n\nThe 02:24 checkpoint below is retained as a historical snapshot and is superseded by this exact-head update.\n3:## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-26 13:45 UTC)\n13:## Historical checkpoint (observed 2026-10-26 08:05 UTC)\n23:## Historical checkpoint (observed 2026-10-26 06:24 UTC at `bbafae868939084ccd49f21621695dff6b05f752`)\n32:## Historical checkpoint (observed 2026-10-26 02:27 UTC at `62e541c9e170a51d02420753f0807c14d65d7074`)\n42:## Historical checkpoint (observed 2026-10-26 02:24 UTC at `62e541c9e170a51d02420753f0807c14d65d7074`; superseded by 02:27 update)\n56:## Historical checkpo