{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T17:39:59.117Z","ordinal":394705,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_060b64278a9dfb15016adf906797b881a09bbc270cfdc30e2f","status":"completed","call_id":"call_15411d00264441a9b804b03e7107af0f","name":"exec","input":"const r = await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"python3 - <<'PY'\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\np=Path('docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md')\\ns=p.read_text()\\ninsert='''## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-26 17:40 UTC)\\\\n\\\\n**Authoritative source and source gates:** `origin/main` is `4cae11cbc3b0eab9bd6f56df7cc34e946b5dc566`, the merge commit for PR #258. Exact-main CI [40363722642](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40363722642) and CodeQL [40363722565](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40363722565) both completed SUCCESS on this exact commit; Node 22, Node 24, and Linux packaging/reproducibility/install checks all passed. In a clean detached worktree at this exact SHA with isolated HOME/XDG, `node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check` confirmed all components are `1.0.0-rc.9`, and `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` passed: 123 rows (108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open), with 12 requirements explicitly deferred to exact-RC qualification. These are source-stage results; they do not satisfy the deferred qualification gates.\\\\n\\\\n**Integrated defect fixes:** PR #258 fixed the legacy local-provider credential-origin rebinding finding and updated RC9 notes. It was independently source-reviewed ACCEPT on exact diff SHA-256 `1e7a8414b112d895345b14a7e27b9d7769428df6c904cde09ff8ef0f23061fe1`; PR CI [40357724824](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40357724824) and CodeQL [40357724535](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40357724535) passed before merge. The reviewer’s GitHub review was a COMMENT, not an APPROVE. PR #256 local endpoint setup and PR #253 one-reset release-download retry are also integrated. This records source behavior only; installed exact-RC provider and upgrade acceptance have not run.\\\\n\\\\n**Candidate and publication state:** The latest published candidate remains [v1.0.0-rc.8](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc.8). RC9 has not been tagged or built for qualification. No stable `v1.0.0` release exists. Candidate construction remains gated on the independent custodian accepting held-out corpus integrity, coverage, compatibility, and execution-boundary evidence.\\\\n\\\\n**Qualification and external dependencies:** Held-out qualification has not started. Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1#issuecomment-6423073471) was updated at 17:37 UTC with current source evidence and a request for safe custody status; no custodian response is recorded yet, and Agent Mail reports no active project window identities. No private corpus payloads were accessed. The Ubuntu/GNOME terminal environment has been inventoried, but the human matrix remains 0/15 because no exact RC9 package is installed. Once an RC is eligible, a human must complete the five-terminal, three-size matrix using `scripts/terminal-acceptance/README.md`; PTY automation cannot replace the required real-terminal results and screenshots.\\\\n\\\\n**Disposition:** `NEXUS_V1_CONVERGENCE_ACTIVE`; acceptance `IN_PROGRESS`. Source gates are green. The next release-critical dependency is independent held-out custody acceptance; exact-RC qualification, provider/standalone runs, cross-runner checks, terminal evidence, and independent RC acceptance remain pending.\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n'''\\nmarker='# v1.0.0 release readiness checkpoint\\\\n\\\\n'\\nif not s.startswith(marker): raise SystemExit('unexpected readiness document header')\\np.write_text(marker+insert+s[len(marker):])\\nPY\\ngit diff --check; git status --short; git diff --stat; git log -5 --oneline\",workdir:\"/home/mike/nexus-wt/readiness-rc8-install-terminal-20261026\",yield_time_ms:10000,max_output_tokens:1000}); text(r.output);","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a178fa-f0ed-7ab3-bb71-477460bd1a0a","create_time":1793036391.594602}}}
