{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T17:51:44.412Z","ordinal":395214,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a178fa-f0ed-7ab3-bb71-477460bd1a0a","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-fada28db-be0f-44e2-9e9b-79267f05b4c7","process_id":"71013","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/readiness-rc8-install-terminal-20261026 diff 4cae11cbc3b0eab9bd6f56df7cc34e946b5dc566...HEAD -- docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md | sed -n '1,220p'"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/readiness-rc8-install-terminal-20261026 diff 4cae11cbc3b0eab9bd6f56df7cc34e946b5dc566...HEAD -- docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md | sed -n '1,220p'"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"diff --git a/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md b/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md\nindex 36d9c5b..c18d0c8 100644\n--- a/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md\n+++ b/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md\n@@ -1,6 +1,59 @@\n # v1.0.0 release readiness checkpoint\n \n-## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-26 13:45 UTC)\n+## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-26 17:40 UTC)\n+\n+**Authoritative source and source gates:** `origin/main` is `4cae11cbc3b0eab9bd6f56df7cc34e946b5dc566`, the merge commit for PR #258. Exact-main CI [40363722642](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40363722642) and CodeQL [40363722565](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40363722565) both completed SUCCESS on this exact commit; Node 22, Node 24, and Linux packaging/reproducibility/install checks all passed. In a clean detached worktree at this exact SHA with isolated HOME/XDG, `node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check` confirmed all components are `1.0.0-rc.9`, and `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` passed: 123 rows (108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open), with 12 requirements explicitly deferred to exact-RC qualification. These are source-stage results; they do not satisfy the deferred qualification gates.\n+\n+**Integrated defect fixes:** PR #258 fixed the legacy local-provider credential-origin rebinding finding and updated RC9 notes. It was independently source-reviewed ACCEPT on exact diff SHA-256 `1e7a8414b112d895345b14a7e27b9d7769428df6c904cde09ff8ef0f23061fe1`; PR CI [40357724824](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40357724824) and CodeQL [40357724535](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40357724535) passed before merge. The reviewer’s GitHub review was a COMMENT, not an APPROVE. PR #256 local endpoint setup and PR #253 one-reset release-download retry are also integrated. This records source behavior only; installed exact-RC provider and upgrade acceptance have not run.\n+\n+**Candidate and publication state:** The latest published candidate remains [v1.0.0-rc.8](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc.8). RC9 has not been tagged or built for qualification. No stable `v1.0.0` release exists. Candidate construction remains gated on the independent custodian accepting held-out corpus integrity, coverage, compatibility, and execution-boundary evidence.\n+\n+**Qualification and external dependencies:** Held-out qualification has not started. Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1#issuecomment-6423073471) was updated at 17:37 UTC with current source evidence and a request for safe custody status; no custodian response is recorded yet, and Agent Mail reports no active project window identities. No private corpus payloads were accessed. The Ubuntu/GNOME terminal environment has been inventoried, but the human matrix remains 0/15 because no exact RC9 package is installed. Once an RC is eligible, a human must complete the five-terminal, three-size matrix using `scripts/terminal-acceptance/README.md`; PTY automation cannot replace the required real-terminal results and screenshots.\n+\n+**Disposition:** `NEXUS_V1_CONVERGENCE_ACTIVE`; acceptance `IN_PROGRESS`. Source gates are green. The next release-critical dependency is independent held-out custody acceptance; exact-RC qualification, provider/standalone runs, cross-runner checks, terminal evidence, and independent RC acceptance remain pending.\n+\n+---\n+\n+## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-26 15:16 UTC)\n+\n+**PR #256 exact-head update:** Following independent source-review acceptance of candidate `987c73a8178390b0ed710474648ca1a71eaf060e`, the reviewed branch was pushed as a normal fast-forward from `c3bb2235286a154280f8578458a4dc8570ae542a`. PR [#256](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/256) now targets exact `origin/main` `ff349383537b10ec6198ceb0961e833bd519c2b4`; its hosted CI run [40347686120](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40347686120) and CodeQL [40347686125](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40347686125) are in progress. Do not merge until every required exact-head check completes successfully and branch protection/review requirements are satisfied. The 15:15 checkpoint immediately below remains accurate as a pre-push snapshot and is superseded for PR head and CI status by this update.\n+\n+\n+## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-26 15:15 UTC)\n+\n+**Authoritative source gates:** `origin/main` is `ff349383537b10ec6198ceb0961e833bd519c2b4`. Exact-main post-merge CI [40340228722](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40340228722) completed SUCCESS on that commit across Node 22, Node 24, and Linux packaging, including the reproducibility build. Post-merge CodeQL [40340228417](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40340228417) passed. Requirements enforcement and `sync-version --check` passed on exact `ff349383`; 123 requirement rows remain with 12 explicitly deferred to exact-RC qualification. Components remain `1.0.0-rc.8`.\n+\n+**PR #256 local-provider candidate:** Public PR [#256](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/256) still points to stale head `c3bb2235286a154280f8578458a4dc8570ae542a` on base `b73b6ecaf753ff3eba8d5e1930ede7a471359421`. The refreshed local candidate is `987c73a8178390b0ed710474648ca1a71eaf060e`, based on current main `ff349383` through normal merge commit `9d898eb9bb77a87490d6fcf47b11260193b1e315`; it is not yet pushed and has no hosted exact-head checks. Independent source review ACCEPTed the full candidate diff (SHA-256 `7dc76f1d5d9ee3dd6ebd982eaefc250cd9862043de1f901bf73f58a26d43e376`) and confirmed prior findings are addressed. The implementer reports focused provider-connect tests 33/33, TUI Rust tests 6/6, TypeScript build, and `git diff --check` pass; no local full suite was run. Run exact PR checks after updating the public branch before integration.\n+\n+**Acceptance blockers:** Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains OPEN; its latest metadata-only custody request at 12:18 UTC has no custodian response. Independent private custody, evaluator-compatible corpus sealing, and held-out acceptance remain unestablished; no held-out payload was accessed or run. Current-candidate provider/standalone, T2/T3/T4, cross-runner and independent exact-RC acceptance remain incomplete. The human terminal matrix remains **0/15**. RC8 is a prior prerelease, not a qualified candidate for this source; stable v1.0.0 is unpublished. Acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`; publication authority remains granted but gated.\n+\n+The 15:02 checkpoint immediately below is retained as historical evidence; this update supersedes its main CI and PR #256 review status.\n+\n+\n+## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-26 15:02 UTC)\n+\n+**Authoritative source and source gates:** `origin/main` is `ff349383537b10ec6198ceb0961e833bd519c2b4`. Post-merge CI run [40340228722](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40340228722) is bound to that exact commit: Node 22 and Node 24 jobs passed; `linu