ed worktree at this SHA with isolated HOME/XDG, `node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check` confirmed all components are `1.0.0-rc.9`, and `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` passed: 123 rows (108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open), with 12 requirements explicitly deferred to exact-RC qualification. These are source-stage results; they do not satisfy deferred qualification gates.\n \n-**Integrated defect fixes:** PR #258 fixed the legacy local-provider credential-origin rebinding finding and updated RC9 notes. It was independently source-reviewed ACCEPT on exact diff SHA-256 `1e7a8414b112d895345b14a7e27b9d7769428df6c904cde09ff8ef0f23061fe1`; PR CI [40357724824](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40357724824) and CodeQL [40357724535](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40357724535) passed before merge. The reviewer’s GitHub review was a COMMENT, not an APPROVE. PR #256 local endpoint setup and PR #253 one-reset release-download retry are also integrated. This records source behavior only; installed exact-RC provider and upgrade acceptance have not run.\n+**Integrated fixes:** PR #258 fixed the legacy local-provider credential-origin rebinding finding and updated RC9 notes. It was independently source-reviewed ACCEPT on exact diff SHA-256 `1e7a8414b112d895345b14a7e27b9d7769428df6c904cde09ff8ef0f23061fe1`; PR CI [40357724824](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40357724824) and CodeQL [40357724535](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40357724535) passed before merge. The review was a GitHub COMMENT, not an APPROVE. PR #256 local endpoint setup and PR #253 one-reset release-download retry are also integrated. Installed exact-RC provider and upgrade acceptance have not run.\n \n-**Candidate and publication state:** The latest published candidate remains [v1.0.0-rc.8](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc.8). RC9 has not been tagged or built for