{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T17:54:07.242Z","ordinal":395332,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a178fa-f0ed-7ab3-bb71-477460bd1a0a","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adf93be79f881a0879fc52aea096286","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The readiness PR now reflects the signed RC9 tag and active build, the RC8 dogfooding export’s exact limitations, and the desktop’s terminal-app/authentication preflight. It is updated at `d508e19`; its new exact-head CI is running, and I requested a fresh independent review of the correction."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1793037246528,"completed_at_ms":1793037247242}}
