{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T17:55:49.321Z","ordinal":395419,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_060b64278a9dfb15016adf9423531481a0aa8a679d5a39e0b5","status":"completed","call_id":"call_a45b23aec61245bea57c2a699b7a0fb6","name":"exec","input":"// @exec: {\"max_output_tokens\": 2500}\nconst r = await Promise.allSettled([\n  tools.exec_command({cmd:\"git status --short --branch && git worktree list --porcelain | sed -n '1,100p' && git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/readiness-rc8-install-terminal-20261026 status --short --branch 2>&1 && git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/readiness-rc8-install-terminal-20261026 log -1 --oneline 2>&1\",workdir:\"/home/mike/nexus-code\",yield_time_ms:10000,max_output_tokens:1800}),\n  tools.exec_command({cmd:\"rg -n -i 'nexus v1|rc9|release convergence' /home/mike/.codex/memories/MEMORY.md | head -30\",workdir:\"/home/mike/nexus-code\",yield_time_ms:10000,max_output_tokens:500}),\n  tools.mcp__mcp_search__work_state_read({list:\"nexus-v1-release\",includeClosed:false})\n]);\nfor (let i=0;i<r.length;i++) text(`---${i}---\\n${JSON.stringify(r[i])}`);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a178fa-f0ed-7ab3-bb71-477460bd1a0a","create_time":1793037347.3268952}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T17:55:49.411Z","ordinal":395420,"type":"token_usage_record","payload":{"thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a178fa-f0ed-7ab3-bb71-477460bd1a0a","session_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","root_turn_id":"01a178fa-f0ed-7ab3-bb71-477460bd1a0a","response_id":"resp_060b64278a9dfb15016adf9420859881a09ecfd423573c29ab","usage":{"input_tokens":73753,"cached_input_tokens":63232,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":506,"reasoning_output_tokens":231,"total_tokens":74259},"turn_token_usage":{"input_tokens":46957144,"cached_input_tokens":46476800,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":130303,"reasoning_output_tokens":72930,"total_tokens":47087447},"thread_token_usage":{"input_tokens":7269550914,"cached_input_tokens":7192502016,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":20740187,"reasoning_output_tokens":12024054,"total_tokens":7290291101}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T17:55:49.468Z","ordinal":395421,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a178fa-f0ed-7ab3-bb71-477460bd1a0a","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-1c4b84e0-53cb-416e-945a-b12cff9dd46b","server":"mcp-search","tool":"work_state_read","arguments":{"list":"nexus-v1-release","includeClosed":false},"pluginId":"claude-mem@claude-mem-local","readOnlyHint":true,"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"- nexus-v1-release: pr133_ci=Node20/22/24 and CodeQL passed exact head; Linux packaging run 39665020828 active, pr133_head=6f522952bb50d956f259068b0a34151f614c956a, next=Wait for package/repro/install/attestation steps. Once release is created, verify assets and provenance, dispatch cross-runner reproducibility, install exact workflow-produced artifact in isolated qualification environment, then run available non-held-out gates. Keep custody, human terminal and independent acceptance distinctions., current_main=4cae11cbc3b0eab9bd6f56df7cc34e946b5dc566 verified origin/main, sbom=PR134 merged as 049880f; exact PR CI39679493728 all4 SUCCESS, CodeQL39679493753 SUCCESS, focused SBOM closure tests 10/10 PASS, independent ACCEPT; post-merge main gates pass, active_claims=Release publisher remains active; SUITE now released after exact main CI and CodeQL terminal success; no other local test started, blocking_decision=RC2 Node floor: awaiting user's choice between DEC-12 >=20 with EOL disclosure and newer reported no-EOL mandate >=22, pr126_status=Merged 2026-10-21T23:16:39Z as f8ba4c1248d400ac321aec1d08b74437a1c8d70b after exact-head CI run39688533586 all four success and CodeQL39688533646 success. Postmerge main CI39692357597 and CodeQL39692357575 in progress. PR127/128 old checks are stale because base ffad03f; must refresh/requalify serially. PR135 CI active on previous main 049880f; refresh after terminal., pr135_status=Exact head 771849b64cccb41ed4d9fb2c6e91458c36d3e34b CI39689926298 all four jobs SUCCESS and CodeQL39689926282 SUCCESS, but it is based on old main 049880f; main moved to f8ba4c after PR126. Refresh readiness claim to current main after postmerge CI39692357597/CodeQL39692357575 terminal and rerun exact-head checks., main_postmerge_CI=Run40243331324 exact main431cb194: Node22 and Node24 full test matrices SUCCESS; linux-x86_64 remains active at Node runtime install after earlier build/requirements/cargo gates., main_postmerge_CodeQL=Run 40171717805 exact main 05994a4 SUCCESS., PR127=open; refreshed exact head f9d2743decd2dd3a4816f3bd8b5ec7f00d7a8801 based on ac8a97; normal push from remote head 0d87c00; independent review ACCEPT; exact CI39706694418 and 39706694528 running, CodeQL39706694522 SUCCESS; SUITE exclusive claim held, contest_freeze=none; user confirms contest has ended, release_status=Only public releases are prereleases through v1.0.0-rc.8; no accepted RC and no stable v1.0.0 publication. Acceptance IN_PROGRESS., current_main_CI=40363722642 exact 4cae11c: Node22/24 SUCCESS; Linux full CLI suite now SUCCESS; Linux security, requirements, two reproducible package builds, SBOM, smoke/install gates are running. CodeQL40363722565 SUCCESS., REDACTED SUCCESS exact main, release_blocker=exact-main behavioral CI failures on Node22 and Node24; awaiting workflow logs after terminal to identify cases and classify, PR128=candidate 8e114e2 based on 7952fac; independent review ACCEPT; no push/tests until main failure is triaged and exact main source suite passes, pr139=MERGED; exact PR CI39721786589 and CodeQL39721786428 PASS, independent ACCEPT; post-merge CI39725081299 and CodeQL39725081349 in progress, runtime_policy_conflict=Awaiting user choice: merged DEC-12 >=20 with EOL disclosure vs later relayed no-EOL-runtime mandate and draft PR137 >=22; do not alter runtime floor until resolved, pr128_head=8b585b5aa0223dcd2cd8f2bd90cb27c858dd66d3 pushed normal fast-forward after main CI; independent review AC