ly source-reviewed ACCEPT on exact diff SHA-256 `1e7a8414b112d895345b14a7e27b9d7769428df6c904cde09ff8ef0f23061fe1`; PR CI [40357724824](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40357724824) and CodeQL [40357724535](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40357724535) passed before merge. The review was a GitHub COMMENT, not an APPROVE. PR #256 local endpoint setup and PR #253 one-reset release-download retry are also integrated. Installed exact-RC provider and upgrade acceptance have not run.\n8: \n9: **RC9 candidate build:** Signed tag `v1.0.0-rc.9` (`d211d1c7545d2dd629531e4f712e98a240a782c6`) points to source commit `4cae11cbc3b0eab9bd6f56df7cc34e946b5dc566`. Release workflow [40370485753](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40370485753) is still running `npm --prefix cli test`; no RC9 GitHub release assets or provenance are published yet. RC8 remains the latest published prerelease. RC9 is only a candidate build, not an accepted RC; no exact-RC qualification or stable `v1.0.0` release is claimed.\n10: \n11: **Operator-reported RC8 dogfooding:** Session export `session_20261026_162439_34f2cnrn` (SHA-256 `6eee8181c62cfc278183ff65f27485d5c224046b6bc5107cc95b0c849a199d87`) is attributed by the operator to RC8 on `mike-dev`. It records a codebase-review task that wrote `docs/codebase-review-enhancements.md` (14,175 bytes). The export has no candidate/package identity, worktree binding, or validation receipts; its final task outcome is `NOT_ESTABLISHED` because the `make test` verifier failed before executing tests (`hasExecutedTests=false`), and `unverifiedChangesPending=true`. This is useful exploratory dogfood feedback only, not exact-RC, requirement, or acceptance evidence.\n12: \n13: **Qualification and terminal setup:** Held-out qualification has not started. Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1#issuecomment-6423073471) received a metadata-only custody follow-up at 17:37 UTC; no custodian response or assignee is recorded, and Agent Mail reports no active project window identities. No private corpus payloads were accessed. The Ubuntu desktop at `10.0.8.3` is reachable over strict-host-key SSH; GitHub CLI authentication is present, the GNOME Wayland session is active, and xterm, kitty, GNOME Terminal, tmux, and VS Code are installed. The human terminal matrix remains 0/15 until the workflow-produced exact RC is installed and an operator records each real terminal/size cell with required screenshots. Automated PTY checks cannot replace this evidence.\n14: \n15: **Disposition:** `NEXUS_V1_CONVERGENCE_ACTIVE`; acceptance `IN_PROGRESS`. Source gates are green. RC9 packaging is still running. Independent held-out custody, installed-RC qualification, provider/standalone runs, cross-runner checks, the human terminal matrix, and independent RC acceptance remain pending.\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":792095065}},"started_at_ms":1793037404257,"completed_at_ms":1793037405050}}
