{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T17:57:05.927Z","ordinal":395492,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a178fa-f0ed-7ab3-bb71-477460bd1a0a","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-ce1bc788-9a57-4781-acc9-064838a21d7e","process_id":"48693","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","git diff -- docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md | sha256sum; git diff -- docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md | sed -n '1,80p'"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-wt/readiness-rc8-install-terminal-20261026","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"git diff -- docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md | sha256sum; git diff -- docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md | sed -n '1,80p'"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"6e475dcc4cc947ce619c825bf0757c0a8e491017b669bb15bfb4b0119a005426  -\ndiff --git a/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md b/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md\nindex cc3be40..690c364 100644\n--- a/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md\n+++ b/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md\n@@ -1,18 +1,18 @@\n # v1.0.0 release readiness checkpoint\n \n-## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-26 17:52 UTC)\n+## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-26 18:06 UTC)\n \n **Authoritative source and source gates:** `origin/main` is `4cae11cbc3b0eab9bd6f56df7cc34e946b5dc566`, the merge commit for PR #258. Exact-main CI [40363722642](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40363722642) and CodeQL [40363722565](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40363722565) completed SUCCESS on this exact commit; Node 22, Node 24, and Linux packaging/reproducibility/install checks passed. In a clean detached worktree at this SHA with isolated HOME/XDG, `node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check` confirmed all components are `1.0.0-rc.9`, and `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` passed: 123 rows (108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open), with 12 requirements explicitly deferred to exact-RC qualification. These are source-stage results; they do not satisfy deferred qualification gates.\n \n **Integrated fixes:** PR #258 fixed the legacy local-provider credential-origin rebinding finding and updated RC9 notes. It was independently source-reviewed ACCEPT on exact diff SHA-256 `1e7a8414b112d895345b14a7e27b9d7769428df6c904cde09ff8ef0f23061fe1`; PR CI [40357724824](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40357724824) and CodeQL [40357724535](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40357724535) passed before merge. The review was a GitHub COMMENT, not an APPROVE. PR #256 local endpoint setup and PR #253 one-reset release-download retry are also integrated. Installed exact-RC provider and upgrade acceptance have not run.\n \n-**RC9 candidate build:** Signed tag `v1.0.0-rc.9` (`d211d1c7545d2dd629531e4f712e98a240a782c6`) points to source commit `4cae11cbc3b0eab9bd6f56df7cc34e946b5dc566`. Release workflow [40370485753](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40370485753) is still running `npm --prefix cli test`; no RC9 GitHub release assets or provenance are published yet. RC8 remains the latest published prerelease. RC9 is only a candidate build, not an accepted RC; no exact-RC qualification or stable `v1.0.0` release is claimed.\n+**RC9 candidate build:** Tag `v1.0.0-rc.9` (tag object `d211d1c7545d2dd629531e4f712e98a240a782c6`) points to source commit `4cae11cbc3b0eab9bd6f56df7cc34e946b5dc566`. `git verify-tag` reports a good signature from the release key, and GitHub commit verification reports `verified: true, reason: valid`. Release workflow [40370485753](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40370485753) remains in progress at package smoke tests (`scripts/smoke-package.sh`); no RC9 GitHub release assets or provenance are published yet. RC8 remains the latest published prerelease. RC9 is only a candidate build, not an accepted RC; no exact-RC qualification or stable `v1.0.0` release is claimed.\n \n **Operator-reported RC8 dogfooding:** Session export `session_20261026_162439_34f2cnrn` (SHA-256 `6eee8181c62cfc278183ff65f27485d5c224046b6bc5107cc95b0c849a199d87`) is attributed by the operator to RC8 on `mike-dev`. It records a codebase-review task that wrote `docs/codebase-review-enhancements.md` (14,175 bytes). The export has no candidate/package identity, worktree binding, or validation receipts; its final task outcome is `NOT_ESTABLISHED` because the `make test` verifier failed before executing tests (`hasExecutedTests=false`), and `unverifiedChangesPending=true`. This is useful exploratory dogfood feedback only, not exact-RC, requirement, or acceptance evidence.\n \n-**Qualification and terminal setup:** Held-out qualification has not started. Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1#issuecomment-6423073471) received a metadata-only custody follow-up at 17:37 UTC; no custodian response or assignee is recorded, and Agent Mail reports no active project window identities. No private corpus payloads were accessed. The Ubuntu desktop at `10.0.8.3` is reachable over strict-host-key SSH; GitHub CLI authentication is present, the GNOME Wayland session is active, and xterm, kitty, GNOME Terminal, tmux, and VS Code are installed. The human terminal matrix remains 0/15 until the workflow-produced exact RC is installed and an operator records each real terminal/size cell with required screenshots. Automated PTY checks cannot replace this evidence.\n+**Qualification and terminal setup:** Held-out qualification has not started. Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1#issuecomment-6423073471) received a metadata-only custody follow-up at 17:37 UTC; no custodian response or assignee is recorded, and Agent Mail reports no active project window identities. No private corpus payloads were accessed. The Ubuntu desktop at `10.0.8.3` is reachable over strict-host-key SSH; GitHub CLI authentication is present, the GNOME Wayland session is active, and xterm, kitty, GNOME Terminal, tmux, and VS Code are installed. The GNOME Shell screenshot D-Bus service is also available; standalone screenshot utilities are absent, so evidence capture should use the desktop screenshot UI or the available GNOME service. The human terminal matrix remains 0/15 until the workflow-produced exact RC is installed and an operator records each real terminal/size cell with required screenshots. Automated PTY checks cannot replace this evidence.\n \n-**Disposition:** `NEXUS_V1_CONVERGENCE_ACTIVE`; acceptance `IN_PROGRESS`. Source gates are green. RC9 packaging is still running. Independent held-out custody, installed-RC qualification, provider/standalone runs, cross-runner checks, the human terminal matrix, and independent RC acceptance remain pending.\n+**Disposition:** `NEXUS_V1_CONVERGENCE_ACTIVE`; acceptance `IN_PROGRESS`. Source gates are green. RC9 packaging is at smoke tests. Independent held-out custody, installed-RC qualification, provider/standalone runs, cross-runner checks, the human terminal matrix, and independent RC acceptance remain pending.\n \n ---\n \n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":816247801}},"started_at_ms":1793037425110,"completed_at_ms":1793037425927}}
