equires a clean worktree, rejects `--ledger` overrides, enforces source-ledger thresholds outside the explicit §1.1 lifecycle rows, and requires the exact-RC record itself to meet the normal status threshold for every row. It never mutates the source ledger or relaxes a requirement's B/RR record threshold. The checker verifies source/tag/artifact/evidence hash bindings; it does not authenticate the reviewer or prove that the artifact was built from the source commit. The approved release workflow must independently verify build provenance/attestation, and the designated custodian and independent reviewer must verify their respective approvals and custody evidence.\\n\"}}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a178fa-f0ed-7ab3-bb71-477460bd1a0a","create_time":1793037442.6888738}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
