{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T18:03:26.295Z","ordinal":395810,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a178fa-f0ed-7ab3-bb71-477460bd1a0a","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-596efe80-f7eb-48d9-9552-ada0d89bce46","process_id":"7042","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","ssh -o BatchMode=yes -o StrictHostKeyChecking=yes mike@10.0.8.3 'sha256sum \"$HOME/.local/nexus-rc9-qualification/lib/nexus/v1.0.0-rc.9/MANIFEST.sha256\"; \"$HOME/.local/nexus-rc9-qualification/bin/nexus\" --help | sed -n \"1,18p\"; \"$HOME/.local/nexus-rc9-qualification/bin/nexus\" doctor --help | sed -n \"1,20p\"' 2>&1"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"ssh -o BatchMode=yes -o StrictHostKeyChecking=yes mike@10.0.8.3 'sha256sum \"$HOME/.local/nexus-rc9-qualification/lib/nexus/v1.0.0-rc.9/MANIFEST.sha256\"; \"$HOME/.local/nexus-rc9-qualification/bin/nexus\" --help | sed -n \"1,18p\"; \"$HOME/.local/nexus-rc9-qualification/bin/nexus\" doctor --help | sed -n \"1,20p\"' 2>&1"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"4cf1b288892891c3db6135c8bb9919e4a21e871ef2c5be5c211e39fa13bde0e6  /home/mike/.local/nexus-rc9-qualification/lib/nexus/v1.0.0-rc.9/MANIFEST.sha256\nUsage: nexus [options] [command]\n\nNexus Code - Custom Autonomous Coding Harness for Local AI (LM Studio / vLLM)\n\nOptions:\n  -V, --version                                output the version number\n  --repl                                       Start interactive coding session (REPL)\n  --live                                       Start live TUI\n  -r, --resume [id]                            Resume previous session (defaults to latest if id omitted)\n  --approve                                    Require human approval before destructive actions (edits, shell commands)\n  -y, --yes                                    Run non-interactively without approval prompts (forces auto mode)\n  --mode <mode>                                Execution mode: auto, review, or read-only (default: review; folder trust does not change it)\n  --read-only                                  Reject all mutating tool executions and commands\n  -e, --endpoint <url>                         Local LLM endpoint (default: $LOCAL_LLM_ENDPOINT)\n  -m, --model <name>                           Model name identifier (default: active model in vLLM)\n  -w, --workspace <path>                       Workspace directory (default: current directory)\n  -s, --max-steps <number>                     Steps per segment; continuation checkpoints there instead of stopping (default: 30)\n  --max-total-steps <number>                   Continuation: an explicit total-step limit for one turn (default: none; progressing work continues)\nUsage: nexus doctor [options]\n\nDiagnose configuration, endpoint, credentials, engine, shell, state and\nextensions without starting an agent\n\nOptions:\n  -e, --endpoint <url>    Endpoint to diagnose (default: as a session would\n                          resolve it)\n  -m, --model <name>      Model to check for\n  -k, --api-key <key>     Credential to test (never printed)\n  --provider <id>         Cloud inference provider (openrouter, openai,\n                          anthropic, compatible, ...)\n  --base-url <url>        Override the provider's base URL\n  -w, --workspace <path>  Workspace directory\n  --shell <type>          Shell to check\n  --json                  Emit only the versioned JSON report (schemaVersion 2)\n  --deep                  Also run deeper checks: one minimal inference request\n                          (costs model work), an engine tool call, state write\n                          probes, all session records\n  --fix                   Propose the supported repairs and apply them after\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":1,"nanos":297835752}},"started_at_ms":1793037804996,"completed_at_ms":1793037806295}}
