{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T18:04:58.744Z","ordinal":395879,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_060b64278a9dfb15016adf9642dc4481a088df025f2f17f859","status":"completed","call_id":"call_9871f1fcab8744499894a008b585b614","name":"exec","input":"const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Add File: /home/mike/nexus-wt/readiness-rc8-install-terminal-20261026/docs/v1.0.0/evidence/rc9_artifact_install.md\\n+# RC9 artifact integrity and isolated installation record\\n+\\n+**Observed:** 2026-10-26 18:00 UTC  \\n+**Release:** `v1.0.0-rc.9`  \\n+**Source commit:** `4cae11cbc3b0eab9bd6f56df7cc34e946b5dc566`  \\n+**Disposition:** Artifact integrity and installation smoke evidence only. This is not exact-RC product qualification or acceptance.\\n+\\n+## Published source and release\\n+\\n+- The annotated tag object is `d211d1c7545d2dd629531e4f712e98a240a782c6`, targeting the source commit above.\\n+- Local `git verify-tag v1.0.0-rc.9` returned a good signature from `Mike Holownych <mike.holownych@aisyndicate.io>`.\\n+- GitHub's commit API reports the source commit verification as `verified: true`, `reason: valid`.\\n+- GitHub's tag-object API separately reports `verified: false`, `reason: bad_email`. The local signature result does not change or override GitHub's tag-object status.\\n+- Release workflow [40370485753](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40370485753) completed successfully. The prerelease was published at 2026-10-26 17:56:16 UTC.\\n+- Published Linux x86-64 archive: `nexus-linux-x86_64-v1.0.0-rc.9.tar.gz`, 4,859,736 bytes, SHA-256 `35795d2b7639b68a541c512976d8bc7f251115ebdccf48f6b9cf5f98ef1af9bb`.\\n+- Published `SHA256SUMS` asset SHA-256: `70a80c9afb658c40506534e8fd80eb5e7b4cdd28431aa7fd0e285f136513ce77`.\\n+- Downloading all listed release assets and running `sha256sum -c SHA256SUMS` succeeded for the archive and `compatibility.json`.\\n+- `gh attestation verify` exited 0 for both the archive and `SHA256SUMS`, against repository `mikeholownych/nexus-code`. The verified archive attestation subject digest matches the published archive digest above.\\n+\\n+## Isolated desktop installation\\n+\\n+The official `install.sh` asset was run on the connected Ubuntu/GNOME desktop with:\\n+\\n+```sh\\n+NEXUS_VERSION=v1.0.0-rc.9 \\\\\\n+NEXUS_PREFIX=\\\"$HOME/.local/nexus-rc9-qualification\\\" \\\\\\n+NEXUS_VERIFY_ATTESTATION=1 sh install.sh\\n+```\\n+\\n+The installer reported successful provenance verification for the archive and checksum index, installed into the new isolated prefix, and its pre-install binary self-test passed. The existing default Nexus installation and its RC6/RC8 version directories were not changed.\\n+\\n+The installed `--version` output was `1.0.0-rc.9 (4cae11cbc3b0)`. Its `.provenance.json` records source revision `4cae11cbc3b0eab9bd6f56df7cc34e946b5dc566` and archive SHA-256 `35795d2b7639b68a541c512976d8bc7f251115ebdccf48f6b9cf5f98ef1af9bb`. The installed `MANIFEST.sha256` file's SHA-256 is `4cf1b288892891c3db6135c8bb9919e4a21e871ef2c5be5c211e39fa13bde0e6`.\\n+\\n+## Limits of this record\\n+\\n+This records artifact identity, published checksums, provenance verification results, and an installed-package version/self-test. It does not establish provider behavior, upgrade behavior from RC6, held-out results, standalone engineering correctness, T3/T4 results, cross-runner reproducibility, the manual terminal matrix, or independent RC acceptance. Acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`.\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a178fa-f0ed-7ab3-bb71-477460bd1a0a","create_time":1793037890.8630247}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T18:04:58.771Z","ordinal":395880,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a178fa-f0ed-7ab3-bb71-477460bd1a0a","item":{"type":"FileChange","id":"exec-98075425-b264-4638-959c-0b0b2efc5be5","changes":{"/home/mike/nexus-wt/readiness-rc8-install-terminal-20261026/docs/v1.0.0/evidence/rc9_artifact_install.md":{"type":"add","content":"# RC9 artifact integrity and isolated installation record\n\n**Observed:** 2026-10-26 18:00 UTC  \n**Release:** `v1.0.0-rc.9`  \n**Source commit:** `4cae11cbc3b0eab9bd6f56df7cc34e946b5dc566`  \n**Disposition:** Artifact integrity and installation smoke evidence only. This is not exact-RC product qualification or acceptance.\n\n## Published source and release\n\n- The annotated tag object is `d211d1c7545d2dd629531e4f712e98a240a782c6`, targeting the source commit above.\n- Local `git verify-tag v1.0.0-rc.9` returned a good signature from `Mike Holownych <mike.holownych@aisyndicate.io>`.\n- GitHub's commit API reports the source commit verification as `verified: true`, `reason: valid`.\n- GitHub's tag-object API separately reports `verified: false`, `reason: bad_email`. The local signature result does not change or override GitHub's tag-object status.\n- Release workflow [40370485753](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40370485753) completed successfully. The prerelease was published at 2026-10-26 17:56:16 UTC.\n- Published Linux x86-64 archive: `nexus-linux-x86_64-v1.0.0-rc.9.tar.gz`, 4,859,736 bytes, SHA-256 `35795d2b7639b68a541c512976d8bc7f251115ebdccf48f6b9cf5f98ef1af9bb`.\n- Published `SHA256SUMS` asset SHA-256: `70a80c9afb658c40506534e8fd80eb5e7b4cdd28431aa7fd0e285f136513ce77`.\n- Downloading all listed release assets and running `sha256sum -c SHA256SUMS` succeeded for the archive and `compatibility.json`.\n- `gh attestation verify` exited 0 for both the archive and `SHA256SUMS`, against repository `mikeholownych/nexus-code`. The verified archive attestation subject digest matches the published archive digest above.\n\n## Isolated desktop installation\n\nThe official `install.sh` asset was run on the connected Ubuntu/GNOME desktop with:\n\n```sh\nNEXUS_VERSION=v1.0.0-rc.9 \\\nNEXUS_PREFIX=\"$HOME/.local/nexus-rc9-qualification\" \\\nNEXUS_VERIFY_ATTESTATION=1 sh install.sh\n```\n\nThe installer reported successful provenance verification for the archive and checksum index, installed into the new isolated prefix, and its pre-install binary self-test passed. The existing default Nexus installation and its RC6/RC8 version directories were not changed.\n\nThe installed `--version` output was `1.0.0-rc.9 (4cae11cbc3b0)`. Its `.provenance.json` records source revision `4cae11cbc3b0eab9bd6f56df7cc34e946b5dc566` and archive SHA-256 `35795d2b7639b68a541c512976d8bc7f251115ebdccf48f6b9cf5f98ef1af9bb`. The installed `MANIFEST.sha256` file's SHA-256 is `4cf1b288892891c3db6135c8bb9919e4a21e871ef2c5be5c211e39fa13bde0e6`.\n\n## Limits of this record\n\nThis records artifact identity, published checksums, provenance verification results, and an installed-package version/self-test. It does not establish provider behavior, upgrade behavior from RC6, held-out results, standalone engineering correctness, T3/T4 results, cross-runner reproducibility, the manual terminal matrix, or independent RC acceptance. Acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`.\n"}},"status":"completed","stdout":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA /home/mike/nexus-wt/readiness-rc8-install-terminal-20261026/docs/v1.0.0/evidence/rc9_artifact_install.md\n","stderr":""},"started_at_ms":1793037898770,"completed_at_ms":1793037898771}}
