{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T18:08:22.972Z","ordinal":396086,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a178fa-f0ed-7ab3-bb71-477460bd1a0a","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-d51ddcd1-cb6d-4df1-a23c-eef3333e8b89","process_id":"36775","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","rg -n 'DEC-06|OpenRouter|pinned model|gpt-6|nvidia/nemotron|deepseek' docs/v1.0.0/DECISIONS.md docs/v1.0.0/evidence/live | head -55; rg -n 'providers verify' docs/v1.0.0"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-wt/readiness-rc8-install-terminal-20261026","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"search","cmd":"rg -n 'DEC-06|OpenRouter|pinned model|gpt-6|nvidia/nemotron|deepseek' docs/v1.0.0/DECISIONS.md docs/v1.0.0/evidence/live","query":"DEC-06|OpenRouter|pinned model|gpt-6|nvidia/nemotron|deepseek","path":"DECISIONS.md"},{"type":"search","cmd":"rg -n 'providers verify' docs/v1.0.0","query":"providers verify","path":"v1.0.0"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"docs/v1.0.0/DECISIONS.md:14:| [DEC-06](#dec-06-supported-providers-for-v1) | Supported providers | Local OpenAI-compatible + OpenRouter supported; others experimental until live-verified | No |\ndocs/v1.0.0/DECISIONS.md:112:**Inference environment.** All runs go through the homelab-ai gateway, which is the only inference path (owner, 2026-10-14). There is no direct worker access and no extra GPU. Every run, Nexus and peers alike, is serial on one gateway-backed model. Wall time is the critical-path cost (PLAN-10). Live cloud connections (ChatGPT sign-in, OpenRouter) may be used for small-spend checks, but are not used for matched comparisons. One reason: `openrouter/free` routed 3 requests to 3 different models in the 2026-10-14 verify run, which breaks model matching.\ndocs/v1.0.0/DECISIONS.md:116:## DEC-06: Supported providers for v1\ndocs/v1.0.0/DECISIONS.md:122:| **Supported** | OpenRouter | Live-verified 2026-10-14 at db1ca55 (`evidence/live/verify_openrouter.json`); re-verify at RC with a **pinned** model (not `openrouter/free`). |\ndocs/v1.0.0/DECISIONS.md:248:| X4 | **Partly resolved 2026-10-14:** the existing ChatGPT sign-in and OpenRouter connections are authorized for small-spend checks; both were live-verified at db1ca55. Optional: add OpenAI API-key or Anthropic keys if those providers should be listed as supported. | DEC-06 | M5 (optional) |\ndocs/v1.0.0/evidence/live/verify_openrouter_pinned_2026-10-16.json:3:  \"model\": \"nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free\",\ndocs/v1.0.0/evidence/live/verify_openrouter_pinned_2026-10-16.json:32:      \"selectedModel\": \"nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free\",\ndocs/v1.0.0/evidence/live/verify_openrouter_pinned_2026-10-16.json:33:      \"effectiveModel\": \"nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free\",\ndocs/v1.0.0/evidence/live/verify_openrouter_pinned_2026-10-16.json:55:      \"selectedModel\": \"nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free\",\ndocs/v1.0.0/evidence/live/verify_openrouter_pinned_2026-10-16.json:56:      \"effectiveModel\": \"nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free\",\ndocs/v1.0.0/evidence/live/verify_openrouter_pinned_2026-10-16.json:78:      \"selectedModel\": \"nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free\",\ndocs/v1.0.0/evidence/live/verify_openrouter_pinned_2026-10-16.json:79:      \"effectiveModel\": \"nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free\",\ndocs/v1.0.0/evidence/live/verify_chatgpt.json:3:  \"model\": \"gpt-6-luna\",\ndocs/v1.0.0/evidence/live/verify_chatgpt.json:32:      \"selectedModel\": \"gpt-6-luna\",\ndocs/v1.0.0/evidence/live/verify_chatgpt.json:33:      \"effectiveModel\": \"gpt-6-luna\",\ndocs/v1.0.0/evidence/live/verify_chatgpt.json:53:      \"selectedModel\": \"gpt-6-luna\",\ndocs/v1.0.0/evidence/live/verify_chatgpt.json:54:      \"effectiveModel\": \"gpt-6-luna\",\ndocs/v1.0.0/evidence/live/verify_chatgpt.json:74:      \"selectedModel\": \"gpt-6-luna\",\ndocs/v1.0.0/evidence/live/verify_chatgpt.json:75:      \"effectiveModel\": \"gpt-6-luna\",\ndocs/v1.0.0/evidence/live/verify_chatgpt_pinned_2026-10-16.json:3:  \"model\": \"gpt-6-luna\",\ndocs/v1.0.0/evidence/live/verify_chatgpt_pinned_2026-10-16.json:32:      \"selectedModel\": \"gpt-6-luna\",\ndocs/v1.0.0/evidence/live/verify_chatgpt_pinned_2026-10-16.json:33:      \"effectiveModel\": \"gpt-6-luna\",\ndocs/v1.0.0/evidence/live/verify_chatgpt_pinned_2026-10-16.json:54:      \"selectedModel\": \"gpt-6-luna\",\ndocs/v1.0.0/evidence/live/verify_chatgpt_pinned_2026-10-16.json:55:      \"effectiveModel\": \"gpt-6-luna\",\ndocs/v1.0.0/evidence/live/verify_chatgpt_pinned_2026-10-16.json:76:      \"selectedModel\": \"gpt-6-luna\",\ndocs/v1.0.0/evidence/live/verify_chatgpt_pinned_2026-10-16.json:77:      \"effectiveModel\": \"gpt-6-luna\",\ndocs/v1.0.0/evidence/live/verify_openrouter.json:33:      \"effectiveModel\": \"nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free\",\ndocs/v1.0.0/EVIDENCE.md:46:| L1 | `nexus providers verify --provider chatgpt -m gpt-6-luna -j` | PASS: streamed completion, tool call, tool-result round trip | `8e910140…`, `1e6c5946…`, `d8595745…` | `evidence/live/verify_chatgpt.json` |\ndocs/v1.0.0/EVIDENCE.md:47:| L2 | `nexus providers verify --provider openrouter -m openrouter/free -j` | PASS. The effective model varied per request (nemotron-3-super, then laguna-xs-2.1, then laguna-s-2.1), which shows `openrouter/free` is unsuitable for matched evaluation. | `49b71fc3…`, `b05711f6…`, `2b9cc6c5…` | `evidence/live/verify_openrouter.json` |\ndocs/v1.0.0/DECISIONS.md:123:| **Experimental → Supported if live-verified at RC** | OpenAI API key (Responses), Anthropic (Messages), generic compatible cloud | Not connected on the owner's install. They stay experimental unless keys are added and `nexus providers verify` passes at RC. |\ndocs/v1.0.0/REQUIREMENTS.md:179:| REQ-PRV-111 | DEC-06 | Live `providers verify` for each provider listed as supported. The others are labelled experimental. | compatibility claims | `provider_cli.ts` | **RT 2026-10-14 @db1ca55:** chatgpt (gpt-6-luna) PASS, openrouter (openrouter/free) PASS. **RT 2026-10-16 @6151a23+4d82578, pinned models:** openrouter `nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free` PASS (one model served every request), chatgpt `gpt-6-luna` PASS (`evidence/live/verify_*_pinned_2026-10-16.json`). The run found and fixed the option-scope regression (4d82578). openai-key and anthropic not connected. | partial (repeat on the RC) | ACC-PRV-LIVE | RR | B §6 G2 | SPEC-05 / PLAN-10 |\ndocs/v1.0.0/AUDIT.md:25:| Runtime services | The local inference gateway is configured in `~/.config/nexus/config.env`: endpoint `https://10.0.8.5:8443/v1`, model `engineering/b0`, key redacted, `LOCAL_HARNESS_SHELL=bash`. The repo-tracked `cli/.env` holds LM Studio defaults (`localhost:1234`, key \"local\"). **The audit sent no requests to the gateway.** With owner authorization (2026-10-14, small spend), it made live cloud calls through the existing ChatGPT sign-in and OpenRouter connections: two `providers verify` runs and one `nexus run` bug-fix task. See EVIDENCE §3. | RT (values redacted) |\ndocs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md:114:| ACC-PRV-LIVE | `nexus providers verify --provider <p> -m <pinned model> -j` for each provider listed as supported (DEC-06) | `passed: true`. Receipts archived. |\ndocs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md:154:| OpenRouter, pinned model | Supported | `providers verify` PASS, plus one live small task (a §6-style bug fix) reaching a correct outcome |\ndocs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md:437:| `REQ-PRV-111` | partial | RC-pinned live provider verification is incomplete. Historical OpenRouter/ChatGPT evidence is not RC evidence; OpenRouter must use a pinned model. OpenAI API-key and Anthropic paths have no configured authorization. | Installed RC; available provider authorization | Provider qualification operator | On the RC, run `providers verify` for OpenRouter with a pinned model and complete one live small §6-style bug-fix task with a correct outcome. Repeat ChatGPT sign-in verification and retain PASS on the RC; keep ChatGPT, OpenAI API-key, and Anthropic experimental unless separately verified. |\ndocs/v1.0.0/evidence/B_providers.md:93:| G2 Live cloud qualification limited to openrouter + chatgpt (docs/reviews/NEXUS_CLOUD_PROVIDERS_LIVE_QUALIFICATION_2026-10-11.md, HISTORICAL). openai, anthropic, copilot, compatible: mock-only. | `nexus providers verify --provider {openai,anthropic,copilot,compatible} --model <m> -j` with operator keys; archive JSON. |\ndocs/v1.0.0/evidence/B_providers.md:110:| PRV-R9 | Live `providers verify` PASS for each provider listed as supported in docs, or the doc lists it as mock-only/experimental. | compat/docs | RELEASE-REQUIRED | Archived verify JSON per provider. |\ndocs/v1.0.0/specs/SPEC-10-v1-qualification-and-evaluation.md:82:7. **REQ-QUAL-107. Standalone and provider matrix.** The live standalone set (a T2 subset of ≥ 10 tasks plus a T4 subset) is run through the gateway-stripping proxy in its plain profile and its emulated-server profiles (DEC-16). `providers verify` is run live for each provider listed as supported (DEC-06). Receipts are archived.\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":871358779}},"started_at_ms":1793038102100,"completed_at_ms":1793038102972}}
