 PR #256 local endpoint setup and PR #253 one-reset release-download retry are also integrated. Installed exact-RC provider and upgrade acceptance have not run.\n \n-**RC9 candidate artifact:** Tag `v1.0.0-rc.9` (tag object `d211d1c7545d2dd629531e4f712e98a240a782c6`) points to source commit `4cae11cbc3b0eab9bd6f56df7cc34e946b5dc566`. Local `git verify-tag` reports a good signature. GitHub's source-commit verification is `verified: true, reason: valid`, while its separate tag-object verification is `verified: false, reason: bad_email`. Release workflow [40370485753](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40370485753) completed SUCCESS; the prerelease was published at 17:56 UTC. The archive `nexus-linux-x86_64-v1.0.0-rc.9.tar.gz` is 4,859,736 bytes with SHA-256 `35795d2b7639b68a541c512976d8bc7f251115ebdccf48f6b9cf5f98ef1af9bb`; all release assets match `SHA256SUMS`, and `gh attestation verify` exited 0 for the archive and checksum index. The archive identity and isolated desktop install are recorded in [RC9 artifact verification](evidence/rc9_artifact_install.md). RC9 remains an unaccepted prerelease; exact-RC product qualification and stable `v1.0.0` release are not claimed.\n+**RC9 candidate artifact:** Tag `v1.0.0-rc.9` (tag object `d211d1c7545d2dd629531e4f712e98a240a782c6`) points to source commit `4cae11cbc3b0eab9bd6f56df7cc34e946b5dc566`. Local `git verify-tag` reports a good signature. GitHub's source-commit verification is `verified: true, reason: valid`, while its separate tag-object verification is `verified: false, reason: bad_email`. Release workflow [40370485753](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40370485753) completed SUCCESS; the prerelease was published at 17:56 UTC. The archive `nexus-linux-x86_64-v1.0.0-rc.9.tar.gz` is 4,859,736 bytes with SHA-256 `35795d2b7639b68a541c512976d8bc7f251115ebdccf48f6b9cf5f98ef1af9bb`. All 9 downloaded release assets match their GitHub Release API SHA-256 digests; the separate `SHA256SUMS` file lists the archive and `compatibility.json`, and both entries pass `sha256sum -c`. `gh attestation verify` exited 0 for the archive and checksum index. The archive identity and isolated desktop install are recorded in [RC9 artifact verification](evidence/rc9_artifact_install.md). RC9 remains an unaccepted prerelease; exact-RC product qualification and stable `v1.0.0` release are not claimed.\n \n **Operator-reported RC8 dogfooding:** Session export `session_20261026_162439_34f2cnrn` (SHA-256 `6eee8181c62cfc278183ff65f27485d5c224046b6bc5107cc95b0c849a199d87`) is attributed by the operator to RC8 on `mike-dev`. It records a codebase-review task that wrote `docs/codebase-review-enhancements.md` (14,175 bytes). The export has no candidate/package identity, worktree binding, or validation receipts; its final task outcome is `NOT_ESTABLISHED` because the `make test` verifier failed before executing tests (`hasExecutedTests=false`), and `unverifiedChangesPending=true`. This is useful exploratory dogfood feedback only, not exact-RC, requirement, or acceptance evidence.\n \ndiff --git a/docs/v1.0.0/evidence/rc9_artifact_install.md b/docs/v1.0.0/evidence/rc9_artifact_install.md\nindex 0b07faf..9cc9dfe 100644\n--- a/docs/v1.0.0/evidence/rc9_artifact_install.md\n+++ b/docs/v1.0.0/evidence/rc9_artifact_install.md\n@@ -17,7 +17,8 @@\n - Release workflow [40370485753](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40370485753) completed successfully. The prerelease was published at 2026-10-26 17:56:16 UTC.\n - Published Linux x86-64 archive: `nexus-linux-x86_64-v1.0.0-rc.9.tar.gz`, 4,859,736 bytes, SHA-256 `35795d2b7639b68a541c512976d8bc7f251115ebdccf48f6b9cf5f98ef1af9bb`.\n - Published `SHA256SUMS` asset SHA-256: `70a80c9afb658c40506534e8fd80eb5e7b4cdd28431aa7fd0e285f136513ce77`.\n-- Downloading all listed release assets and running `sha256sum -c SHA256SUMS` succeeded for the archive and `compatibility.json`.\n+- All 9 downloaded release assets matched the 