{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T18:10:49.596Z","ordinal":396214,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a178fa-f0ed-7ab3-bb71-477460bd1a0a","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adf97a8ab6481a0a2f4a3c06350565e","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The documentation correction is now pushed to PR #259 as `8e92af1`; the requirements gate passes on the clean commit. Exact-head CI is still running, and I’ve asked the independent reviewer to reassess the corrected wording. I’m checking whether the RC9 provider lane can safely run from the connected desktop; the mike-dev SSH key changed after the reported rebuild, so I won’t bypass host verification."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1793038248776,"completed_at_ms":1793038249596}}
