{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T18:28:24.769Z","ordinal":396695,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a178fa-f0ed-7ab3-bb71-477460bd1a0a","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adf9bc7df8c81a09ce746963bd7deb4","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The first task attempt exposed two real setup issues: its fixture lacked a verifier Nexus recognizes, and the desktop has Node but not npm/Make. The patch itself passed a separate 14-case oracle, but Nexus correctly ended the run `NOT_ESTABLISHED`; I’m preserving it as a failed qualification attempt. I’m adjusting the fixture to use the supported explicit verifier (`node test.mjs`) and a segment size that honors the intended step cap."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1793039303923,"completed_at_ms":1793039304769}}
