{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T18:37:53.290Z","ordinal":397007,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a178fa-f0ed-7ab3-bb71-477460bd1a0a","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-09521392-5010-4b7a-a6e7-d1a26ab5a523","process_id":"37374","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","ssh -o BatchMode=yes -o StrictHostKeyChecking=yes mike@10.0.8.3 '\"$HOME/.local/nexus-rc9-qualification/bin/nexus\" upgrade --help' && rg -n \"nexus upgrade|upgrade --version|NEXUS_HOME\" docs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md docs/USER_MANUAL.md docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md scripts/install.sh install.sh cli/src/upgrade.ts | head -100"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-wt/readiness-rc8-install-terminal-20261026","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"ssh -o BatchMode=yes -o StrictHostKeyChecking=yes mike@10.0.8.3 '\"$HOME/.local/nexus-rc9-qualification/bin/nexus\" upgrade --help' && rg -n \"nexus upgrade|upgrade --version|NEXUS_HOME\" docs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md docs/USER_MANUAL.md docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md scripts/install.sh install.sh cli/src/upgrade.ts | head -100"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"Usage: nexus upgrade [options]\n\nCompare installed version with a published release and safely upgrade\n\nOptions:\n  --check                  Check for updates without modifying the installation\n  -v, --version <version>  Target an exact published version or tag\n  -y, --yes                Confirm upgrade without interactive prompt (required\n                           when noninteractive)\n  --allow-downgrade        Allow downgrading to an older version\n  -f, --force              Force reinstallation even if already at target\n                           version\n  --prefix <path>          Target installation prefix (defaults to canonical\n                           installation prefix)\n  --json                   Emit structured JSON output\n  --timeout <ms>           Network timeout in milliseconds (default: 15000)\n  --recover                Recover from an interrupted or incomplete upgrade\n                           using the upgrade journal\n  --rollback-binary        Revert executable launcher symlink to previous\n                           installed release\n  --restore-backup <path>  Restore configuration from a specified backup path\n  -h, --help               display help for command\n\nExit codes:\n  0: Success (or already up to date when checking)\n  1: Update available (with --check), or upgrade cancelled/declined\n  2: Operational error (network, release not found, checksum mismatch, permission, unsupported provenance)\n\nrg: scripts/install.sh: No such file or directory (os error 2)\ncli/src/upgrade.ts:243:  const nexusHome = customOptions?.nexusHome ?? process.env.NEXUS_HOME;\ncli/src/upgrade.ts:1051:    if (fs.existsSync(getJournalPath(prefix)) && (!pending || ![\"idle\", \"complete\", \"rolled_back\"].includes(pending.state))) throw new Error(\"Pending or invalid upgrade journal; run nexus upgrade --recover before starting another transaction.\");\ncli/src/upgrade.ts:1358:            tool: \"nexus upgrade\",\ncli/src/upgrade.ts:1389:            tool: \"nexus upgrade\",\ncli/src/upgrade.ts:1422:            tool: \"nexus upgrade\",\ncli/src/upgrade.ts:1451:      if (isJson) console.log(JSON.stringify({ schemaVersion:1, tool:\"nexus upgrade\", status:\"error\", error:recoveryOutcome.details }));\ncli/src/upgrade.ts:1467:              tool: \"nexus upgrade\",\ncli/src/upgrade.ts:1477:        console.error(`nexus upgrade: ${err.message || String(err)}`);\ncli/src/upgrade.ts:1490:              tool: \"nexus upgrade\",\ncli/src/upgrade.ts:1529:          console.log(`Run 'nexus upgrade' to upgrade to the latest stable release.`);\ncli/src/upgrade.ts:1534:          console.log(`Run 'nexus upgrade --version ${comparison.targetVersion} --allow-downgrade' to downgrade.`);\ncli/src/upgrade.ts:1550:              tool: \"nexus upgrade\",\ncli/src/upgrade.ts:1561:        console.error(`nexus upgrade: ${errorMsg}`);\ncli/src/upgrade.ts:1572:              tool: \"nexus upgrade\",\ncli/src/upgrade.ts:1592:          console.log(JSON.stringify({ schemaVersion: 1, tool: \"nexus upgrade\", status: \"declined\", error: msg }, null, 2));\ncli/src/upgrade.ts:1594:          console.error(`nexus upgrade: ${msg}`);\ncli/src/upgrade.ts:1604:        const msg = `nexus upgrade: ${comparison.action} from ${installed.version} to ${comparison.targetVersion} requires confirmation. Re-run with --yes in non-interactive scripts.`;\ncli/src/upgrade.ts:1606:          console.log(JSON.stringify({ schemaVersion: 1, tool: \"nexus upgrade\", status: \"declined\", error: msg }, null, 2));\ncli/src/upgrade.ts:1657:            tool: \"nexus upgrade\",\ncli/src/upgrade.ts:1683:            tool: \"nexus upgrade\",\ncli/src/upgrade.ts:1692:      console.error(`nexus upgrade failed: ${err.message || String(err)}`);\ndocs/USER_MANUAL.md:65:### Upgrading Nexus Code (`nexus upgrade` & `/upgrade`)\ndocs/USER_MANUAL.md:68:nexus upgrade --check\ndocs/USER_MANUAL.md:77:nexus upgrade\ndocs/USER_MANUAL.md:83:nexus upgrade --version v1.0.0\ndocs/USER_MANUAL.md:91:  nexus upgrade --recover\ndocs/USER_MANUAL.md:95:  nexus upgrade --rollback-binary\ndocs/USER_MANUAL.md:99:  nexus upgrade --restore-backup ~/.config/nexus/backups/config.env.bak\ndocs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md:281:| Upgrade self-test failure | `nexus upgrade` (broken candidate package) | Refused. Staging verified before switch; if post-switch verification fails, launcher atomically rolls back to previous target and journal records `rolled_back`. |\ndocs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md:282:| Upgrade crash recovery | `nexus upgrade --recover` | Idempotent recovery. Cleans incomplete staging, restores unverified launcher symlink, verifies functional installation. |\ndocs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md:283:| Backup restore | `nexus upgrade --restore-backup <state-backup-directory>` | Snapshot of configuration and complete durable state restored from a recognized private backup directory (`backup.json`, `state/`, optional `config/`), with strict 0600 file / 0700 directory modes. A canonical `config.env.bak.*` path restores configuration only. Arbitrary files and tar archives are rejected. Run it through the stable `nexus` launcher; close existing legacy clients, then keep version-pinned legacy binaries and direct old entry points offline until the durable restore journal is cleared. |\ndocs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md:284:| Incompatible downgrade | `nexus upgrade --version <v> --allow-downgrade` (incompatible state schema) | Refused fail-closed with actionable state schema explanation. Existing installation unchanged. |\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":1,"nanos":704622953}},"started_at_ms":1793039871584,"completed_at_ms":1793039873290}}
