ly only to RC7. The five-environment by three-size human terminal matrix remains 0/15. T2/T3/T4 and standalone/provider qualification remain incomplete; no held-out execution has started.\ndocs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md:129:**PR #246 / `agent.ts` handoff:** PR [#246](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/246) remains open at `a2aa9b1bbeec022c6f289af94373f97913ebc62f`, based on `0542312a0364b03cec5b66b6cb8234b210805cd2`; `KimiCode-defect-scan` owns the `FILE_cli_src_agent.ts` claim. Its Node 22/24 tests, CodeQL and JavaScript/TypeScript checks passed. In Linux job 121360325779, the CLI suite passed at 02:12:07 UTC, the first Linux package build passed at 02:13:55 UTC, and the reproducibility package build was still running at 02:14 UTC. A read-only merge-tree preflight against current `main` produced `f9653711777c4ad9be0aff59db816ea57b3dfd83` without conflicts; no branch update or merge has been performed. After all current checks finish, the recorded path remains a normal update onto current `main` followed by exact-head checks.\ndocs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md:133:**RC and qualification:** Signed prerelease `v1.0.0-rc.7` still resolves to source `431cb194931f09eaaffdb6880dc464c1d7b5e2a1`, before PR #243 and later main changes; its Linux archive digest is `367e9384e6de6df5801c3b015e7965becccb53b6b11ff94cf906da764724c58a`. RC7 cross-runner reproducibility passed (run [40248074777](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40248074777)) and installed ChatGPT verification passed 3/3 with `gpt-6-luna`; those results apply only to RC7. The five-environment by three-size human terminal matrix remains 0/15. T2/T3/T4 and standalone/provider qualification remain incomplete; no held-out execution has started.\ndocs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md:145:**RC7 qualification evidence:** Signed prerelease `v1.0.0-rc.7` remains the latest published candidate, resolving to source `431cb194931f09eaaffdb6880dc464c1d7b5e2a1`; its Linux archive digest remains `367e9384e6de6df5801c3b015e