{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T18:41:48.131Z","ordinal":397151,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a178fa-f0ed-7ab3-bb71-477460bd1a0a","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adf9ee9a96081a0bc7b60c31bd2e156","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"I reviewed the export. It **does not qualify as exact-RC8 evidence**: it has no candidate identity, worktree binding, or validation receipts, so the export cannot independently tie the run to RC8.\n\nIt records a concrete dogfooding failure: verification is `FAILED` because `make test` found no matching pre-change baseline; **no tests executed**, the deliverable is unbound, and unverified changes remain. The task outcome is `NOT_ESTABLISHED`, even though the final assistant message says “The task is complete.” That mismatch is worth tracking; the final prose should not imply success when the recorded outcome says otherwise.\n\nI would preserve this as **non-qualifying dogfood evidence**, not an accepted qualification result. The export’s SHA-256 is `6eee8181c62cfc278183ff65f27485d5c224046b6bc5107cc95b0c849a199d87`. Acceptance remains **IN_PROGRESS**.\n\n"}],"phase":"final_answer","memory_citation":{"entries":[{"path":"MEMORY.md","lineStart":777,"lineEnd":789,"note":"Nexus release evidence must be bound to exact revisions and qualification remains distinct from dogfood"}],"rolloutIds":[]}},"started_at_ms":1793040105723,"completed_at_ms":1793040108131}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T18:41:48.136Z","ordinal":397152,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","status":"completed","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adf9ee9a96081a0bc7b60c31bd2e156","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"I reviewed the export. It **does not qualify as exact-RC8 evidence**: it has no candidate identity, worktree binding, or validation receipts, so the export cannot independently tie the run to RC8.\n\nIt records a concrete dogfooding failure: verification is `FAILED` because `make test` found no matching pre-change baseline; **no tests executed**, the deliverable is unbound, and unverified changes remain. The task outcome is `NOT_ESTABLISHED`, even though the final assistant message says “The task is complete.” That mismatch is worth tracking; the final prose should not imply success when the recorded outcome says otherwise.\n\nI would preserve this as **non-qualifying dogfood evidence**, not an accepted qualification result. The export’s SHA-256 is `6eee8181c62cfc278183ff65f27485d5c224046b6bc5107cc95b0c849a199d87`. Acceptance remains **IN_PROGRESS**.\n\n<oai-mem-citation>\n<citation_entries>\nMEMORY.md:777-789|note=[Nexus release evidence must be bound to exact revisions and qualification remains distinct from dogfood]\n</citation_entries>\n<rollout_ids>\n</rollout_ids>\n</oai-mem-citation>","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a178fa-f0ed-7ab3-bb71-477460bd1a0a","create_time":1793040105.6663888,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}},"metadata":{"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adf9ee9a96081a0bc7b60c31bd2e156","turn_id":"01a178fa-f0ed-7ab3-bb71-477460bd1a0a","role":"assistant"},"revision":"retained_01a17984-ca68-7a93-ac60-988780e94efc","complete":true},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":19529}}
