{"timestamp":"2026-10-27T01:56:33.722Z","ordinal":397250,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17b11-0941-7523-8004-970495a9563a","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-c6bec8db-81b6-46a9-8cf3-16e498d6d6d1","process_id":"8719","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","gh issue view 1 --repo mikeholownych/nexus-code --json number,title,state,updatedAt,comments,url | jq '{number,title,state,updatedAt,url,comments:(.comments|map({author:.author.login,createdAt,body:(.body|.[0:700])})|.[-8:])}'; printf '\\nRC10 release state\\n'; gh release view v1.0.0-rc.10 --repo mikeholownych/nexus-code --json tagName,isPrerelease,isDraft,publishedAt,url,assets | jq '{tagName,isPrerelease,isDraft,publishedAt,url,assets:(.assets|map({name,size,digest}))}'"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"gh issue view 1 --repo mikeholownych/nexus-code --json number,title,state,updatedAt,comments,url | jq '{number,title,state,updatedAt,url,comments:(.comments|map({author:.author.login,createdAt,body:(.body|.[0:700])})|.[-8:])}'; printf '\\nRC10 release state\\n'; gh release view v1.0.0-rc.10 --repo mikeholownych/nexus-code --json tagName,isPrerelease,isDraft,publishedAt,url,assets | jq '{tagName,isPrerelease,isDraft,publishedAt,url,assets:(.assets|map({name,size,digest}))}'"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"{\n  \"number\": 1,\n  \"title\": \"PLAN-10 task 8: finish and seal the held-out T2/T3 corpus\",\n  \"state\": \"OPEN\",\n  \"updatedAt\": \"2026-10-26T17:37:53Z\",\n  \"url\": \"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1\",\n  \"comments\": [\n    {\n      \"author\": \"mikeholownych\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-23T10:23:00Z\",\n      \"body\": \"Metadata-only checkpoint request for the independent held-out custodian. No private corpus material has been accessed.\\n\\nRC3 (`v1.0.0-rc.3`) is published, but no held-out qualification has started. The public 40-task manifest still uses the legacy `hidden.command` shape rejected by the current `blackbox-v1` runner, and the prior status requests have no custodian response.\\n\\nPlease provide only safe status metadata:\\n- current author/custodian owner and claim or handoff reference;\\n- whether lossless conversion is being done by the custodian or a new immutable manifest is needed, with next checkpoint/ETA;\\n- whether completeness, coverage, setup/reference validation, integrity, access controls, an\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"author\": \"mikeholownych\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-24T00:19:17Z\",\n      \"body\": \"Metadata-only custody checkpoint from the release coordinator. I found no current held-out author/custodian claim in the shared claim ledger; the last public custodian response request was October 23 10:23 UTC. Please reply only with safe status metadata: (1) current independent author and custodian, including the acknowledged claim/handoff; (2) whether the 40-task corpus and setup/reference validation are complete; (3) whether the legacy runner-format incompatibility has a custodian-approved immutable resolution; and (4) whether access separation, digests, independence, and custody have been accepted. If the current custodian is unavailable, please state that explicitly and identify the aut\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"author\": \"mikeholownych\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-24T02:16:57Z\",\n      \"body\": \"Metadata-only custody status request: please confirm the current author/custodian owner and progress toward the 40-task corpus, including coverage/validation counts, setup and reference-validation status, private digest re-derivation, store and parent access controls, exposure-history review, immutable seal status, and expected custody acceptance. Please do not post task prompts, answers, validators, or other protected payloads here. Held-out qualification remains blocked until the independent custodian verifies completeness, coverage, integrity, and execution-boundary separation.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"author\": \"mikeholownych\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-25T03:55:09Z\",\n      \"body\": \"Release convergence update (public metadata only): post-merge CI and CodeQL now pass on current main `4e7297f545538e6422ca3890334a7036f58287ca` (CI run `40156576300`, CodeQL run `40156576296`). RC4 remains the newest prerelease; no stable release or final-candidate qualification has been established. The terminal matrix remains 0/15, T4 has not run, and the reproducibility workflow has not run on an RC. The metadata-only custody request from 2026-10-24 02:16 UTC remains unanswered.\\n\\nPlease reply to that request with the current custodian/owner, status and expected timing for independent custody acceptance, and whether a lossless compatibility path or replacement corpus is planned for the cur\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"author\": \"mikeholownych\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-25T06:51:23Z\",\n      \"body\": \"Follow-up for the current release candidate path (public metadata only): the current evaluator requires the blackbox-v1 task contract, while prior custody records describe the sealed legacy hidden-command corpus. Please confirm the currently assigned custodian, whether the sealed 40-task corpus can be qualified losslessly under the current evaluator or requires a newly versioned corpus, and the expected timing for the required custody acceptance and frozen run metadata. Please do not post task objectives, source payloads, validators, reference solutions, hidden results, or credentials here. No held-out execution has started.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"author\": \"mikeholownych\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-26T02:33:48Z\",\n      \"body\": \"Public metadata-only follow-up: current `origin/main` is `62e541c9e170a51d02420753f0807c14d65d7074`; its source CI and CodeQL have passed, and PR #246 is in exact-head CI after rebasing onto that commit. Held-out qualificati