\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/259\",\n  \"body\": \"## Summary\\n\\n- Refresh the top readiness checkpoint against exact `main` after PRs #260 and #261 merged.\\n- Record the RC9 installed `TERM=dumb` accessibility failure separately from the source fix now on `main`.\\n- Preserve the RC9 artifact/install evidence and historical checkpoints.\\n- Keep held-out custody, all-state qualification, human terminal acceptance, independent RC acceptance, and stable publication explicitly open.\\n\\n## Validation\\n\\n- `git diff --check` — PASS.\\n- Verified the linked RC9 accessibility evidence README exists in the merged repository.\\n- Requirements enforcement and artifact/install checks from the earlier checkpoint remain documented as historical evidence; this refresh does not relabel them as current-candidate acceptance.\\n- Independent read-only review by `rc5_candidate_review` — ACCEPT; exact diff SHA-256 `4be0c43e2c336196501c5ebceb54370eea05207190678e79fe8927a957c2df9e`.\\n- Exact-head CI run 40402462905 is running and CodeQL run 40402462767 passed on `1c6c8392130033381d445a9516f0145a88e22999`, based on main `30f1b89a88bac81d8ab2d4f1e6800e1978a61f38`.\\n\\nRC9 remains an unaccepted prerelease. Its immutable installed artifact still fails the recorded `TERM=dumb` subcases; the main-branch fix requires a new immutable RC and requalification. No held-out payload was accessed.\\n\",\n  \"reviews\": [\n    {\n      \"author\": \"mikeholownych\",\n      \"state\": \"COMMENTED\",\n      \"submittedAt\": \"2026-10-26T17:55:33Z\",\n      \"body\": \"### Independent Read-Only Review: PR #259\\n\\n**Commit Under Review:** [`d508e1998d879dc4e0005b8c6a0cc3e2ccc2bda1`](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/commit/d508e1998d879dc4e0005b8c6a0cc3e2ccc2bda1)  \\n**Base Commit:** [`4cae11cbc3b0eab9bd6f56df7cc34e946b5dc566`](https://github.com/mikeholowny\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"checks\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"test-matrix (22)\",\n      \"status\": \"COMPLET