559)); this was not the user's normal Nexus installation and is not full installed-RC acceptance. The tag's local GPG signature verifies, but GitHub reports it as unverified (`bad_email`); the stable tag must use a signer identity that GitHub verifies against the signing key. The earlier RC6-to-RC7 upgrade attempt failed because RC6 rejected GitHub's signed release-asset redirect. The redirect allowlist and URL-secret redaction are present in RC8; the RC6 installation was not changed by the isolated RC8 check.\n71-\n72:**Acceptance blockers:** Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains OPEN; the custodian has not responded to the metadata-only request, and private custody acceptance, evaluator compatibility and sealing are not established. Held-out qualification has not started. Exact-RC provider/standalone qualification, T2/T3 and nine-class T4 qualification, and independent RC acceptance remain incomplete. The human terminal matrix remains 0/15; automated PTY checks do not satisfy it. Stable `v1.0.0` is not published. Campaign status remains `NEXUS_V1_CONVERGENCE_ACTIVE`; acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`; publication authorization remains granted but gated on acceptance.\n73-\n74:The 06:24 checkpoint immediately below is retained as a historical snapshot; this update supersedes its CI conclusion, RC publication state, cross-runner status, and current blocker summary.\n75-\n76-## Historical checkpoint (observed 2026-10-26 06:24 UTC at `bbafae868939084ccd49f21621695dff6b05f752`)\n--\n78-**Authoritative source and source gates:** `origin/main` is `bbafae868939084ccd49f21621695dff6b05f752`, incorporating PR #249 (`8e562b0f3406e94003806746cb69a5258f72a59f`) and PR #250. PR #249 merged at 05:57 UTC and PR #250 merged at 06:20 UTC. On this exact source, `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` passed with 123 rows (108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 12 requirements explicitly deferred to exact-RC qualification), and `node s