{"timestamp":"2026-10-27T01:59:59.517Z","ordinal":397400,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17b11-0941-7523-8004-970495a9563a","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-da87a285-785c-4aa7-a406-e6cc56b75266","process_id":"15328","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","set -e\nwt=/home/mike/nexus-wt/rc10-desktop-install-prep\nif git -C \"$wt\" ls-remote --exit-code --heads origin v1/rc10-desktop-install-prep >/dev/null 2>&1; then echo 'remote branch already exists'; exit 2; fi\ngit -C \"$wt\" push -u origin v1/rc10-desktop-install-prep\ngh pr create --repo mikeholownych/nexus-code --base main --head v1/rc10-desktop-install-prep --title 'docs(qualification): prepare RC10 terminal matrix on Ubuntu desktop' --body-file - <<'BODY'\n## Summary\n\n- Record strict-provenance installation of the exact published RC10 artifact on `ubuntu-desktop` in a separate qualification prefix.\n- Preserve the existing default launcher and record that no interactive terminal cell was run.\n- Provide the exact five-environment, three-size manual matrix and accepted check/screenshot procedure.\n\n## Evidence boundary\n\nThis is installation and environment preflight only. The manual matrix remains 0/15, and no human terminal acceptance is claimed.\n\n## Validation\n\n- Verified the downloaded official installer digest against the RC10 tag and GitHub Release API.\n- Installed with `NEXUS_VERIFY_ATTESTATION=1`; archive and checksum-index provenance verified.\n- Installed version/source identity and package manifest verified.\n- `git diff --check` passed.\n- No test suite was run locally because the exclusive `SUITE` claim is in use by the RC10 scripted terminal lane; exact-head CI will run on this PR.\nBODY"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"set -e\nwt=/home/mike/nexus-wt/rc10-desktop-install-prep\nif git -C \"$wt\" ls-remote --exit-code --heads origin v1/rc10-desktop-insta