d the work. Inspect the\n   evidence. Keep the decision yours.\n\n\n\n\n enter send · shift+enter newline ·…────\n› ask Nexus · / for commands · ? for ke…\n\n===== command-approval @ 1.91s (40x14) =====\n NEXUS   ws  model m  mode: review\n╭ Approval needed ─────────────────────╮\n│Run echo synthetic-safe               │\n│Proposed: run a shell command in the  │\n│  workspace                           │\n│                                      │\n│$ echo synthetic-safe                 │\n│                                      │\n│ Approve   All later   Deny           │\n│←→ choose, enter · esc denies         │\n╰──────────────────────────────────────╯\n\n approval needed · ←→ then enter (t…────\n›\n\n===== timeout-harmless command completion @ 24.17s (40x14) =====\n NEXUS   ws  model m  mode: review\n╭ Approval needed ─────────────────────╮\n│Run echo synthetic-safe               │\n│Proposed: run a shell command in the  │\n│  workspace                           │\n│                                      │\n│$ echo synthetic-safe                 │\n│                                      │\n│ y Approve   a All later   n Deny     │\n│y or n, or ←→ then enter              │\n╰──────────────────────────────────────╯\n\n approval needed · y approve · n de…────\n›\n--- notes ---\n[   1.01s] SAW idle\n[   1.01s] SCREEN idle (40x14)\n[   1.01s] SEND b'run harmless command\\r'\n[   1.91s] SAW harmless command approval\n[   1.91s] SCREEN command-approval (40x14)\n[   4.41s] SEND b'y'\n[   5.61s] SEND b'\\x1b[D'\n[   8.12s] SEND b'\\r'\n[   8.92s] SEND b'\\r'\n[  24.17s] TIMEOUT waiting for harmless command completion\n[  24.17s] SCREEN timeout-harmless command completion (40x14)\n--- gateway trace ---\n{\"time\": 1793066185.2219603, \"path\": \"/v1/chat/completions\", \"user\": \"run harmless command\\n\\n[Git Status: master (0 uncommitted dirty files)]\", \"tools\": 0}\n{\"time\": 1793066194.299079, \"path\": \"/v1/chat/completions\", \"user\": \"run harmless command\\n\\n[Git Status: master (0 uncommitted dirty files)]\", \"tools\": 1}\n--- run script ---\nimport sys,subprocess,time,pathlib,json,os\nsys.path.insert(0,str(pathlib.Path(__file__).parent))\nfrom ptylib import *\nroot=pathlib.Path(__file__).parent; port=root/'gw.port'; gwlog=root/'gw.log'\ngw=subprocess.Popen([sys.executable,str(root/'mockgw_overlay.py'),str(port),str(gwlog)])\ntry:\n  for _ in range(100):\n    if port.exists() and port.read_text(): break\n    time.sleep(.05)\n  ep='http://127.0.0.1:'+port.read_text()+'/v1'; env,ws,home=make_env('overlay_dumb40',ep,{'TERM':'dumb'})\n  s=Session(tui_argv(ws,ep),env,40,14,ws,'overlay_dumb40')\n  try:\n    assert s.wait('enter send',15,'idle'); s.dump('idle')\n    s.send(b'run harmless command\\r'); assert s.wait('Approval needed',10,'harmless command approval'); s.dump('command-approval')\n    s.pump(2.5); s.send(b'y'); s.pump(1); s.send(b'\\x1b[D'); s.pump(2.3); s.send(b'\\r'); s.pump(.6); s.send(b'\\r'); assert s.wait('Done',15,'harmless command completion'); s.dump('command-completion'); assert s.wait('enter send',10,'command idle')\n    s.send(b'\\t'); s.send(b']'); s.send(b'\\r'); assert s.wait('Tool call',10,'detail'); s.dump('detail'); s.send(b'\\x1b'); assert s.wait('enter send',5,'detail closed')\n  finally:s.close()\nfinally:gw.terminate();gw.wait(timeout=5)\nprint('dry-run finished')\n--- related evidence docs ---\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/rc10-scripted-terminal/docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.10/cross-runner/README.md\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/rc10-scripted-terminal/docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.10/cross-runner/SHA256SUMS\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/rc10-scripted-terminal/docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.10/cross-runner/manifest.json\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/rc10-scripted-terminal/docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.10/cross-runner/repro-evidence.json\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/rc10-scripted-terminal/docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.10/terminal-manual/README.md\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/rc10-scripted-