rt is synthetic host preflight only (10/10), no tasks/inference., eol_note_correction=PR143 at 96a414f has accepted Node20 EOL date correction in RC1 note; based on 8935918 and needs refresh/checks after current postmerge CI., pr141=Closed as superseded by #140; distinct report and raw log/checksum remain in closed PR history; no test or held-out claims., pr142=Remote head d7170441f648f8b467ada1de37b648216a0c3c79; PR body accurate; independent review ACCEPT; CI39756122354/CodeQL39756122359 in progress; candidate includes DEC-12/REQ-REL-111/ruleset conflict clarification verified; previous 9b7 exact checks all passed, contest_disposition=No contest freeze applies per the user. Exact current main GOVERNANCE.md and C1 plan/spec now explicitly say contest concluded/no freeze. Historical handoff sentence 'material stays frozen' is explicitly marked superseded by DEC-13 status amendment and is retained only as historical record; no active restriction., requirements_enforce=PASS on exact current main merge44ca13d58a262b5f89be459b47aefa50c2d61683 in a clean detached worktree with isolated HOME/XDG. 123 rows:109 tested,5 partial,2 implemented,7 open; exactly 11 explicitly mapped to exact-RC qualification. Source gate only, not installed-RC qualification., pr142_checks=39745603759 exact old head all required jobs SUCCESS including linux-x86_64; base stale, no merge, pr143_checks=39745105660 and CodeQL 119711928416 exact old head all required jobs SUCCESS; base stale, no merge, main_postmerge=CI39747222866 terminal SUCCESS on exact main44ca13d58a262b5f89be459b47aefa50c2d61683; Node20/22/24 and Linux package/repro/security/requirements/smoke/install all pass. CodeQL39747222840 SUCCESS., pr143=Open at 96a414f, checks pass old base 8935918; rebase only after PR142 integrates and subsequent main CI is terminal, pr142_candidate=Remote PR branch now at d7170441f648f8b467ada1de37b648216a0c3c79; exact CI/CodeQL started 09:31:45; prior 9b7 checks both passed; d717 adds factual DEC-12/R