{"timestamp":"2026-10-27T02:02:49.765Z","ordinal":397554,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17b11-0941-7523-8004-970495a9563a","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016ae00648da5c81a0bbe2c72ede0b452d","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"PR #263 is still on the reviewed exact commit; CodeQL passed, while Node 22 and Node 24 test jobs remain in progress. The saved overlay run did not prove a product defect: the harness typed into the approval panel, then pressed the selection/confirmation keys before Nexus’s required quiet and visible-choice intervals elapsed. I’m preparing one isolated synthetic rerun with the documented timing and will preserve the failed run as-is."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1793066568889,"completed_at_ms":1793066569765}}
