{"timestamp":"2026-10-27T02:10:44.262Z","ordinal":397897,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a17b1f-cda6-77c1-b0be-958551b72e82","author":"/root/plan05_readonly_review","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/plan05_readonly_review\nPayload:\n**CHANGES_REQUIRED** for PR #264 at `d00e1cbad6da4b3ec288097da292a1cd13f3753b` against base `16ee8ca3643824741b6da67936b41f262414fdf0` (diff SHA-256 `bb9a770efc9c6734d7fcbe7f8e3261495b38f5cb6c9143850e9287588c81e829`).\n\n- The scripted-evidence checksum is stale: `SHA256SUMS:89` and `manifest.json:266` expect `fe4a5c2a…`, but the committed overlay README hashes to `2ac0cafb…`. Update both references and revalidate the bundle.\n- `corrected-approval-path/README.md:9` says `gw.log` records the final assistant response. The mock log records request metadata; the PTY capture shows the final response. Clarify that distinction.\n\nThe corrected approval repro is properly labeled synthetic and limited in scope. The accessibility disposition remains `PARTIAL_NOT_ACCEPTED`, and the human matrix remains **0/15**."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17b11-0941-7523-8004-970495a9563a","create_time":1793067044.2620285}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":19549}}
