recorded findings have outgrown your memory; 25 of 27 are no longer shown in it in full, more give way with each finding you record, and reading them back with read_findings takes steps. Write what you have established into your work product now (the file or change your task produces; if it produces none, state it in the task_completed summary), before investigating further, then continue with what remains. This is step 145.] {   \"exists\": true,   \"is_binary\": false,   \"is_dir\": false,   \"is_file\": true,   \"is_symlink\": false,   \"line_count\": 262,   \"modified_iso\": \"epoch_secs:1793034370\",   \"path\": \"docs/codebase-review-enhancements.md\",   \"permissions\": \"664\",   \"size_bytes\": 14175 }\n[Nexus: your recorded findings have outgrown your memory; 25 of 27 are no longer shown in it in full, more give way with each finding you record, and reading them back with read_findings takes steps. Write what you have established into your work product now (the file or change your task produces; if it produces none, state it in the task_completed summary), before investigating further, then continue with what remains. This is step 147.] [objective characters 0-83 of 83] Review the codebase. Identify highest ROI for further differentiation enhancements.\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17b11-0941-7523-8004-970495a9563a","create_time":1793067184.4907944}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
