xus-wt/rc10-scripted-terminal log --oneline --decorate -5; echo '--- PR branch tip'; git ls-remote origin refs/heads/v1/rc10-scripted-terminal; echo '--- checksums/wording'; cd /home/mike/nexus-wt/rc10-scripted-terminal && sha256sum docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.10/terminal-scripted/accessibility/overlay-expansion-20261027/README.md && rg -n 'fe4a5c2a|2ac0cafb|gw.log|final assistant|README.md' docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.10/terminal-scripted/SHA256SUMS docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.10/terminal-scripted/manifest.json docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.10/terminal-scripted/accessibility/overlay-expansion-20261027/README.md"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"--- SUITE\nabsent\n--- GATEWAY\nabsent\n--- FILE_docs_reviews_evidence_v1_qualification_rc10_terminal_scripted\nabsent\n--- FILE_docs_reviews_evidence_v1_qualification_rc10_overlay_states\nabsent\n--- branch relation\nd61ff28 (HEAD -> v1/rc10-scripted-terminal) docs(qualification): archive RC10 accessibility rechecks\ne6d2677 docs(qualification): archive RC10 cancel timing recheck\nd00e1cb (origin/v1/rc10-scripted-terminal) docs(qualification): verify RC10 approval timing path\n4eea816 docs(qualification): retain RC10 overlay probe logs\n38373a9 docs(qualification): record supplemental RC10 overlays\n--- PR branch tip\nd00e1cbad6da4b3ec288097da292a1cd13f3753b\trefs/heads/v1/rc10-scripted-terminal\n--- checksums/wording\nc797709d3a1b346e66503341df656443038c3bd7ed646b34755875da643367d9  docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.10/terminal-scripted/accessibility/overlay-expansion-20261027/README.md\ndocs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.10/terminal-scripted/accessibility/overlay-expansion-20261027/README.md:7:Across the original and corrected supplemental probes, all nine `Overlay` variants were observed at `TERM=dumb`, 40×14. The first run rendered `Approval`, `CheckpointChoice`, `Help`, `Receipt`, `Models`, `Connect`, `Paste`, and `Review`; a separate corrected synthetic approval flow rendered `Detail` (see [the Detail capture](corrected-detail-capture-20261027/README.md)). The successful capture is `captured-8-of-9/overlay_dumb40.screens.txt`; its raw PTY stream, driver, mock gateway, and notes are retained alongside it.\ndocs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.10/terminal-scripted/accessibility/overlay-expansion-20261027/README.md:9:Earlier Detail follow-up attempts did not reach the overlay because their approval sequence was mistimed; those logs remain in the neighboring `detail-attempt-*` directories and are harness-incomplete. A later corrected approval sequence did reach and render Detail; its Esc closed the panel, after which the harness used an incorrect idle predicate because transcript focus was active. That UI capture is valid; the last predicate is not counted as a product failure. A pip setup record is included where relevant; no runtime package was installed into the repository. A later focused synthetic follow-up completed the harmless command after using the approval panel's required settle and confirmation timing and correcting the mock's post-tool response; see [corrected approval-path confirmation](corrected-approval-path/README.md). The earlier timeouts were harness/fixture failures for this path, not reproduced product failures.\ndocs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.10/terminal-scripted/SHA256SUMS:1:9bdbe4c55a80790de1c3c6996b708938fa10bfd122b881ce99ae422ee845c646  README.md\ndocs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.10/terminal-scripted/SHA256SUMS:2:9d02d4e934b3436360af95191aa0a10a0374730adf70b794e8722086f25a9ced  accessibility/README.md\ndocs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.10/terminal-scripted/SHA256SUMS:47:cf18cb7a3315a1e59cd01d07a54430071bce907ea495fd5a64d71e2297242a27  accessibility/cancel-timing-recheck-20261027/README.md\ndocs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.10/terminal-scripted/SHA256SUMS:48:dd8eb7e45fd65245af8f1bd971be8d526970bc1302660e9a6