{"timestamp":"2026-10-27T02:15:08.672Z","ordinal":398062,"type":"token_usage_record","payload":{"thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17b23-4ce0-7c11-90c6-74e78e580449","session_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","root_turn_id":"01a17b23-4ce0-7c11-90c6-74e78e580449","response_id":"resp_060b64278a9dfb15016ae0092abbc881a0b0963a4a42a1e4ee","usage":{"input_tokens":112732,"cached_input_tokens":108032,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":160,"reasoning_output_tokens":143,"total_tokens":112892},"turn_token_usage":{"input_tokens":422284,"cached_input_tokens":403712,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":2439,"reasoning_output_tokens":1452,"total_tokens":424723},"thread_token_usage":{"input_tokens":7313637278,"cached_input_tokens":7235670656,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":20960681,"reasoning_output_tokens":12156586,"total_tokens":7334597959}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-27T02:15:10.125Z","ordinal":398063,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","id":"fco_01a17b23-dc2c-7e10-bb5c-62116e10ca40","call_id":"call_cafe9d51a84347b8aca03c37297de9b4","output":"{\"agents\":[{\"agent_name\":\"/root\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/current_main_rc_path_audit\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"PR #256 was merged at `1aa8832`; its exact head, `987c73a8178390b0ed710474648ca1a71eaf060e`, is an ancestor of current `origin/main` at `4cae11c`. The feature branch remains clean at `987c73a`, originally based on `ff34938`. [PR #256](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/256)\\n\\nThe commit fixed pending local-discovery cancellation and late activation, corrected the key-storage message, and isolated invalid provider catalog errors. Its credential-origin fix was incomplete: later review reproduced a legacy key reaching the newly selected endpoint. So that commit alone does not clear the security acceptance blocker.\\n\\nCI passed on PR #256, but GitHub records no reviews, and I found no independent acceptance of exact head `987c73a`. An accepted follow-up exists on branch `v1/defect-malformed-credential-origin` at `0571266`; it has no open PR and is not in current `main`.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/heldout_public_coverage_audit\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"Since the last audit, Issue #1 gained coordinator comment [#6406940449](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1#issuecomment-6406940449); the issue’s `updated_at` is `2026-10-26T02:33:48Z`. It says the custody request remains unanswered. All 20 comments are from the coordinator; no custodian response or handoff is visible.\\n\\nAt `main@bbafae868939084ccd49f21621695dff6b05f752`, the T2 and T3 manifest hashes are unchanged: `50895b84…1f3e89b` and `85fb9caf…c9f1383`. The evaluator still rejects T2’s legacy `hidden.command` for qualification and requires custodian-led conversion or replacement, repeated custody checks, and a new immutable manifest.\\n\\nNo active held-out ownership or handoff appears in the claims records. The same external dependency remains; there is no new custody readiness.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/plan05_readonly_review\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"**CHANGES_REQUIRED** for PR #264 at `d00e1cbad6da4b3ec288097da292a1cd13f3753b` against base `16ee8ca3643824741b6da67936b41f262414fdf0` (diff SHA-256 `bb9a770efc9c6734d7fcbe7f8e3261495b38f5cb6c9143850e9287588c81e829`).\\n\\n- The scripted-evidence checksum is stale: `SHA256SUMS:89` and `manifest.json:266` expect `fe4a5c2a…`, but the committed overlay README hashes to `2ac0cafb…`. Update both references and revalidate the bundle.\\n- `corrected-approval-path/README.md:9` says `gw.log` records the final assistant response. The mock log records request metadata; the PTY capture shows the final response. Clarify that distinction.\\n\\nThe corrected approval repro is properly labeled synthetic and limited in scope. The accessibility disposition remains `PARTIAL_NOT_ACCEPTED`, and the human matrix remains **0/15**.\"}}]}","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17b23-4ce0-7c11-90c6-74e78e580449","create_time":1793067310.1246083}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
