{"timestamp":"2026-10-27T02:15:22.501Z","ordinal":398076,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17b23-4ce0-7c11-90c6-74e78e580449","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-b7024da5-f451-4d29-9396-645b446d717d","process_id":"36170","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","cd /home/mike/nexus-wt/rc10-scripted-terminal && sed -n '1,140p' docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.10/terminal-scripted/accessibility/overlay-expansion-20261027/corrected-approval-path/README.md && git show --stat --oneline d61ff28 && git show d61ff28 -- docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.10/terminal-scripted/SHA256SUMS docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.10/terminal-scripted/manifest.json docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.10/terminal-scripted/accessibility/overlay-expansion-20261027/corrected-approval-path/README.md | head -180"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"cd /home/mike/nexus-wt/rc10-scripted-terminal && sed -n '1,140p' docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.10/terminal-scripted/accessibility/overlay-expansion-20261027/corrected-approval-path/README.md && git show --stat --oneline d61ff28 && git show d61ff28 -- docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.10/terminal-scripted/SHA256SUMS docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.10/terminal-scripted/manifest.json docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.10/terminal-scripted/accessibility/overlay-expansion-20261027/corrected-approval-path/README.md | head -180"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"# RC10 synthetic approval-path confirmation\n\nCandidate: installed `v1.0.0-rc.10`, source `16ee8ca3643824741b6da67936b41f262414fdf0`, Linux x86_64 archive SHA-256 `444d0812ad583b7f688890ac8536cb872e92364c977d9fbf298fa0408d98b3e7`.\n\nThis focused probe used the installed RC10 launcher, a synthetic localhost mock gateway, an isolated HOME/XDG tree, and a disposable Git workspace. It used `TERM=dumb`, 40×14. No live provider, credential, held-out task, or private evaluation data was involved.\n\n## Result\n\nThe harmless `echo synthetic-safe` command completed successfully after the approval was selected and confirmed. The visible panel was allowed to settle; `Left` selected Approve; the two Enter presses were separated by the confirmation dwell. The mock log records the initial tool request, a follow-up request containing one tool result, and the final assistant response. The PTY returned to the idle prompt at 7.92 seconds.\n\nThis resolves the earlier supplemental harness timeout as a probe-sequencing/fixture issue for this specific approval path. In the preserved attempt, `y` was sent while the panel was still in its recent-typing state, then the arrow and Enter keys arrived before the required quiet/choice dwell. A subsequent diagnostic reached tool execution, but that temporary mock returned the same tool call again after the tool result, so its wait for a final response timed out. The final run corrected both the key timing and mock response condition. No product defect was reproduced.\n\nThis is only a synthetic approval-flow probe. It does not qualify all overlays, replace the remaining scripted accessibility checks, satisfy any of the 15 human terminal cells, or change the overall `PARTIAL_NOT_ACCEPTED` disposition.\n\n## Reproduction\n\n`run_corrected.py` launches `mockgw_overlay.py` and the installed RC10 TUI via the existing isolated PTY driver. The driver uses the installed package path documented in the surrounding evidence bundle. `approval_timing.raw`, `approval_timing.screens.txt`, and `approval_timing.notes.txt` preserve the terminal output; `gw.log` preserves the synthetic request/tool-result sequence.\n\n## SHA-256\n\nSee `SHA256SUMS` for this bundle's file hashes.\nd61ff28 docs(qualification): archive RC10 accessibility rechecks\n .../rc.10/terminal-scripted/README.md              |   2 +-\n .../rc.10/terminal-scripted/SHA256SUMS             |  47 +++++-\n .../terminal-scripted/accessibility/README.md      |   7 +-\n .../cancel-timing-recheck-20261027/README.md       |   9 +\n .../mockgw_states.py                               |  50 ++++++\n .../cancel-timing-recheck-20261027/ptylib.py       | 182 +++++++++++++++++++++\n .../cancel-timing-recheck-20261027/results.json    |  37 +++++\n .../run_cancel_timing.py                           |  30 ++++\n .../trial_1.notes.txt                              |   6 +\n .../cancel-timing-recheck-20261027/trial_1.raw     |   1 +\n .../trial_1.screens.txt                            |  32 ++++\n .../trial_2.notes.txt                              |   6 +\n .../cancel-timing-recheck-20261027/trial_2.raw     |   1 +\n .../trial_2.screens.txt                            |  32 ++++\n .../trial_3.notes.txt                              |   6 +\n .../cancel-timing-recheck-20261027/trial_3.raw     |   1 +\n .../trial_3.screens.txt                            |  32 ++++\n .../trial_4.notes.txt                              |   6 +\n .../cancel-timing-recheck-20261027/trial_4.raw     |   1 +\n .../trial_4.screens.txt                            |  32 ++++\n .../trial_5.notes.txt                              |   6 +\n .../cancel-timing-recheck-20261027/trial_5.raw     |   1 +\n .../trial_5.screens.txt                            |  32 ++++\n .../overlay-expansion-20261027/README.md           |   4 +-\n .../corrected-approval-path/SHA256SUMS             |   4 +-\n .../corrected-approval-path/gw.log                 |   2 +\n .../corrected-detail-capture-20261027/README.md    |   7 +\n .../detail_overlay.notes.txt                       |  20 +++\n .../detail_overlay.raw                             |   1 +\n .../detail_overlay.screens.txt                     |  96 +++++++++++\n .../corrected-detail-capture-20261027/gw.log       |   2 +\n .../mockgw_overlay.py                              |  53 ++++++\n .../corrected-detail-capture-20261027/ptylib.py    | 