er keys arrived before the required quiet/choice dwell. A subsequent diagnostic reached tool execution, but that temporary mock returned the same tool call again after the tool result, so its wait for a final response timed out. The final run corrected both the key timing and mock response condition. No product defect was reproduced.\n \ndiff --git a/docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.10/terminal-scripted/accessibility/overlay-expansion-20261027/corrected-approval-path/SHA256SUMS b/docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.10/terminal-scripted/accessibility/overlay-expansion-20261027/corrected-approval-path/SHA256SUMS\nindex 5e0309c..b227494 100644\n--- a/docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.10/terminal-scripted/accessibility/overlay-expansion-20261027/corrected-approval-path/SHA256SUMS\n+++ b/docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.10/terminal-scripted/accessibility/overlay-expansion-20261027/corrected-approval-path/SHA256SUMS\n@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@\n-1761c7a9ede07be79c974ec2d1abb3d5160fd8badb91d8d47aabef1cb05006d6  README.md\n+e65428bf689fa9d1780c7f24827ec1dab83da22dbb823725ed0935b2d0ab5528  README.md\n c52df3ce0bdc43c4e019608d1d46bf7b1e1b18712a58173ddbefbb2391bd7679  approval_timing.notes.txt\n da0c9725c3fe18b198d803aabf328ca3f80e1c389e4622a90aff795dbd6d49a3  approval_timing.raw\n c6e036afdce3492ce9b325a0fc610bb9b32079621184f7d1c67fde440e85a446  approval_timing.screens.txt\ndiff --git a/docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.10/terminal-scripted/manifest.json b/docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.10/terminal-scripted/manifest.json\nindex c80f5d6..866c5f5 100644\n--- a/docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.10/terminal-scripted/manifest.json\n+++ b/docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.10/terminal-scripted/manifest.json\n@@ -309,8 +309,8 @@\n     \"accessibility/overlay-expansion-20261027/detail-attempt-runtime/ptylib.py\": \"0df7c3f82cbb11283c37593076bfbd6a8a3c0a4066276417200ba5e0d274cdbd\",\n     \"accessibility/overlay-expansion-20261027