js --enforce` passes across 123 rows (108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open, 12 deferred to RC qualification).\\\\n\\\\n3. **Release & Candidate Integrity**:\\\\n   - Accurately documents PGP-signed tag `v1.0.0-rc.9` on commit `4cae11c` and in-flight release workflow [40370485753](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40370485753).\\\\n   - Accurately classifies RC9 as a candidate build awaiting qualification, with RC8 remaining the latest published prerelease.\\\\n   - Correctly records operator dogfood export `session_20261026_162439_34f2cnrn` (`6eee8181...`) as exploratory feedback without qualification credit due to missing verifier receipts.\\\\n   - Correctly records human terminal matrix at 0/15 pending real-terminal screenshot execution, and Issue #1 custody request pending custodian response.\\\\n\\\\n4. **Safety & CI Invariants**:\\\\n   - Exact-head CodeQL [Run 40372808452](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40372808452): **✓ SUCCESS**.\\\\n   - Exact-head CI [Run 40372808055](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40372808055): in progress (Node 22 / Node 24).\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n### Verdict\\\\n**ACCEPT** — The documentation accurately and comprehensively reflects the current authoritative source state, candidate build status, and qualification gates. Integration is recommended once CI run 40372808055 completes.\\\",\\\"submittedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-26T17:55:33Z\\\",\\\"includesCreatedEdit\\\":false,\\\"reactionGroups\\\":[],\\\"state\\\":\\\"COMMENTED\\\",\\\"commit\\\":{\\\"oid\\\":\\\"d508e1998d879dc4e0005b8c6a0cc3e2ccc2bda1\\\"}}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"MERGED\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"docs(release): reconcile RC9 accessibility qualification state\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/259\\\"}\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17b23-4ce0-7c11-90c6-74e78e580449","create_time":1793067918.684252}},"metadata":{"client_authored":fals