{"timestamp":"2026-10-27T02:25:29.109Z","ordinal":398544,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_060b64278a9dfb15016ae00b95ab8881a0aea75d2aaa0abb19","status":"completed","call_id":"call_7709588f3d044643a68d9bda1bfb8549","name":"exec","input":"const r=await tools.mcp__mcp_search__work_state_write({list:\"nexus-v1-release\",fields:{\n \"task\":\"Reconcile RC8 dogfood export and continue RC10 release convergence\",\n \"status\":\"doing\",\n \"rc8_dogfood\":\"Verified /home/mike/nexus-code/nexus-session-session_20261026_162439_34f2cnrn.json; exploratory codebase-enhancement review only. No RC/candidate binding or validation receipts; verifier rejected make test (hasExecutedTests=false), unverifiedChangesPending=true. Not qualification evidence. This same evidence was already incorporated in merged PR259.\",\n \"current_main\":\"origin/main 16ee8ca3643824741b6da67936b41f262414fdf0 (fetched and verified); exact CI40419408166 SUCCESS; CodeQL40419408185 SUCCESS; cross-runner RC reproducibility 40433818126 SUCCESS.\",\n \"pr264\":\"Open exact head 78ce94b5c1755658a17a8474f597a7b3ef8f87da, base 16ee8ca. CodeQL success; Node22/24 CI in progress. Independent ACCEPT documented in PR comments/claims; GitHub review array empty. Synthetic scripted evidence only, not human matrix.\",\n \"pr263\":\"Open exact head e83849e5abbf011ff522b72d457e689d60b040fb, base 16ee8ca. Node22/24 and CodeQL success; linux-x86_64 in progress. Human terminal matrix remains 0/15.\",\n \"host_access\":\"Did not connect to rebuilt mike-dev because SSH host key changed and console fingerprint has not been independently verified in this turn; other unblocked lanes continue.\",\n \"acceptance_status\":\"IN_PROGRESS; no accepted RC or stable publication.\",\n \"next\":\"Monitor exact-head CI for PR263/264; merge through protected PR path after required checks and independent review are confirmed; continue only authorized, non-custody qualification work.\"\n}});\ntext(r);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17b23-4ce0-7c11-90c6-74e78e580449","create_time":1793067925.6723225}}}
