{"timestamp":"2026-10-27T02:51:40.438Z","ordinal":399676,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17b23-4ce0-7c11-90c6-74e78e580449","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-3acaa57e-7e1a-4844-b268-3524d0d6005f","server":"codex_apps","tool":"github.get_pr_info","arguments":{"pr_number":263,"repository_full_name":"mikeholownych/nexus-code"},"connectorId":"connector_76869538009648d5b282a4bb21c3d157","linkId":"link_68d2673aabd08191a10c1849bf534da6","appName":"GitHub","actionName":"get_pr_info","readOnlyHint":true,"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Action completed."}],"structuredContent":{"url":"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/263","number":263,"state":"open","merged":false,"mergeable":true,"draft":false,"body":"## Summary\n\n- Record strict-provenance installation of the exact published RC10 artifact on `ubuntu-desktop` in a separate qualification prefix.\n- Preserve the existing default launcher and record that no interactive terminal cell was run.\n- Provide the exact five-environment, three-size manual matrix and accepted check/screenshot procedure.\n\n## Evidence boundary\n\nThis is installation and environment preflight only. The manual matrix remains 0/15, and no human terminal acceptance is claimed.\n\n## Validation\n\n- Verified the downloaded official installer digest against the RC10 tag and GitHub Release API.\n- Installed with `NEXUS_VERIFY_ATTESTATION=1`; archive and checksum-index provenance verified.\n- Installed version/source identity and package manifest verified.\n- `git diff --check` passed.\n- No test suite was run locally because the exclusive `SUITE` claim is in use by the RC10 scripted terminal lane; exact-head CI will run on this PR.\n","title":"docs(qualification): prepare RC10 terminal matrix on Ubuntu desktop","base":"main","base_sha":"16ee8ca3643824741b6da67936b41f262414fdf0","head":"v1/rc10-desktop-install-prep","head_sha":"e83849e5abbf011ff522b72d457e689d60b040fb","head_repo_id":1416386345,"head_repo_full_name":"mikeholownych/nexus-code","merge_commit_sha":"26be32b44bf2b28584de07e4a019bed5f1734d2c","user":{"login":"mikeholownych","name":"mikeholownych","email":null,"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7751780?v=4","id":7751780},"requested_reviewers":null,"requested_team_reviewers":null,"diff":null,"comments":null,"created_at":"2026-10-27T01:59:58Z","updated_at":"2026-10-27T02:01:25Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"commits":1,"changed_files":1,"additions":45,"deletions":0,"display_url":"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/263","display_title":"docs(qualification): prepare RC10 terminal matrix on Ubuntu desktop"},"isError":false},"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":589800638}},"started_at_ms":1793069499847,"completed_at_ms":1793069500437}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-27T02:51:41.911Z","ordinal":399677,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17b23-4ce0-7c11-90c6-74e78e580449","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-a711e747-4fd8-4618-8aaa-9416ec03d2a4","server":"codex_apps","tool":"github.get_pr_info","arguments":{"pr_number":264,"repository_full_name":"mikeholownych/nexus-code"},"connectorId":"connector_76869538009648d5b282a4bb21c3d157","linkId":"link_68d2673aabd08191a10c1849bf534da6","appName":"GitHub","actionName":"get_pr_info","readOnlyHint":true,"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Action completed."}],"structuredContent":{"url":"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/264","number":264,"state":"open","merged":false,"mergeable":true,"draft":false,"body":"## Summary\nArchive the RC10 cross-runner result and scripted terminal accessibility observations, including the corrected synthetic approval-flow repro.\n\n## Evidence boundary\n- Candidate: `v1.0.0-rc.10`, source `16ee8ca3643824741b6da67936b41f262414fdf0`.\n- Linux x86_64 archive SHA-256: `444d0812ad583b7f688890ac8536cb872e92364c977d9fbf298fa0408d98b3e7`.\n- Synthetic PTY probe used the installed RC10 launcher, local mock gateway, and isolated HOME/XDG/workspace.\n- The corrected harmless command approval path completed and returned to idle. Earlier approval timeouts are retained and classified as harness timing/mock-fixture issues for this path.\n- The broader scripted accessibility disposition remains `PARTIAL_NOT_ACCEPTED`; the human five-environment, three-size matrix remains separate and unperformed.\n\n## Validation\n- Evidence bundle SHA-256 manifest verifies.\n- `git diff --check` passes.\n- This PR makes no product source changes and claims no RC or release acceptance.","title":"docs(qualification): archive RC10 scripted terminal evidence","base":"main","base_sha":"16ee8ca3643824741b6da67936b41f262414fdf0","head":"v1/rc10-scripted-terminal","head_sha":"78ce94b5c1755658a17a8474f597a7b3ef8f87da","head_repo_id":1416386345,"head_repo_full_name":"mikeholownych/nexus-code","merge_commit_sha":"6c6eb33cd2cf586614e1eea6ae4bb738bbdd097e","user":{"login":"mikeholownych","name":"mikeholownych","email":null,"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7751780?v=4","id":7751780},"requested_reviewers":null,"requested_team_reviewers":null,"diff":null,"comments":null,"created_at":"2026-10-27T02:07:21Z","updated_at":"2026-10-27T02:22:24Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"commits":11,"changed_files":341,"additions":10701,"deletions":0,"display_url":"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/264","display_title":"docs(qualification): archive RC10 scripted terminal evidence"},"isError":false},"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":466004819}},"started_at_ms":1793069501445,"completed_at_ms":1793069501911}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-27T02:51:43.017Z","ordinal":399678,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a17b45-5229-7091-9353-74aa450389bd","call_id":"call_4cb6251ec0184253b7e6825105278fad","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 3.2 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"pr\":263,\"r\":{\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Action completed.\"}],\"structuredContent\":{\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/263\",\"number\":263,\"state\":\"open\",\"merged\":false,\"mergeable\":true,\"draft\":false,\"body\":\"## Summary\\n\\n- Record strict-provenance installation of the exact published RC10 artifact on `ubuntu-desktop` in a separate qualification prefix.\\n- Preserve the existing default launcher and record that no interactive terminal cell was run.\\n- Provide the exact five-environment, three-size manual matrix and accepted check/screenshot procedure.\\n\\n## Evidence boundary\\n\\nThis is installation and environment preflight only. The manual matrix remains 0/15, and no human terminal acceptance is claimed.\\n\\n## Validation\\n\\n- Verified the downloaded official installer digest against the RC10 tag and GitHub Release API.\\n- Installed with `NEXUS_VERIFY_ATTESTATION=1`; archive and checksum-index provenance verified.\\n- Installed version/source identity and package manifest verified.\\n- `git diff --check` passed.\\n- No test suite was run locally because the exclusive `SUITE` claim is in use by the RC10 scripted terminal lane; exact-head CI will run on this PR.\\n\",\"title\":\"docs(qualification): prepare RC10 terminal matrix on Ubuntu desktop\",\"base\":\"main\",\"base_sha\":\"16ee8ca3643824741b6da67936b41f262414fdf0\",\"head\":\"v1/rc10-desktop-install-prep\",\"head_sha\":\"e83849e5abbf011ff522b72d457e689d60b040fb\",\"head_repo_id\":1416386345,\"head_repo_full_name\":\"mikeholownych/nexus-code\",\"merge_commit_sha\":\"26be32b44bf2b28584de07e4a019bed5f1734d2c\",\"user\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\",\"name\":\"mikeholownych\",\"email\":null,\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7751780?v=4\",\"id\":7751780},\"requested_reviewers\":null,\"requested_team_reviewers\":null,\"diff\":null,\"comments\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-10-27T01:59:58Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-27T02:01:25Z\",\"closed_at\":null,\"merged_at\":null,\"commits\":1,\"changed_files\":1,\"additions\":45,\"deletions\":0,\"display_url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/263\",\"display_title\":\"docs(qualification): prepare RC10 terminal matrix on Ubuntu desktop\"},\"isError\":false}}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"pr\":264,\"r\":{\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Action completed.\"}],\"structuredContent\":{\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/264\",\"number\":264,\"state\":\"open\",\"merged\":false,\"mergeable\":true,\"draft\":false,\"body\":\"## Summary\\nArchive the RC10 cross-runner result and scripted terminal accessibility observations, including the corrected synthetic approval-flow repro.\\n\\n## Evidence boundary\\n- Candidate: `v1.0.0-rc.10`, source `16ee8ca3643824741b6da67936b41f262414fdf0`.\\n- Linux x86_64 archive SHA-256: `444d0812ad583b7f688890ac8536cb872e92364c977d9fbf298fa0408d98b3e7`.\\n- Synthetic PTY probe used the installed RC10 launcher, local mock gateway, and isolated HOME/XDG/workspace.\\n- The corrected harmless command approval path completed and returned to idle. Earlier approval timeouts are retained and classified as harness timing/mock-fixture issues for this path.\\n- The broader scripted accessibility disposition remains `PARTIAL_NOT_ACCEPTED`; the human five-environment, three-size matrix remains separate and unperformed.\\n\\n## Validation\\n- Evidence bundle SHA-256 manifest verifies.\\n- `git diff --check` passes.\\n- This PR makes no product source changes and claims no RC or release acceptance.\",\"title\":\"docs(qualification): archive RC10 scripted terminal evidence\",\"base\":\"main\",\"base_sha\":\"16ee8ca3643824741b6da67936b41f262414fdf0\",\"head\":\"v1/rc10-scripted-terminal\",\"head_sha\":\"78ce94b5c1755658a17a8474f597a7b3ef8f87da\",\"head_repo_id\":1416386345,\"head_repo_full_name\":\"mikeholownych/nexus-code\",\"merge_commit_sha\":\"6c6eb33cd2cf586614e1eea6ae4bb738bbdd097e\",\"user\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\",\"name\":\"mikeholownych\",\"email\":null,\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7751780?v=4\",\"id\":7751780},\"requested_reviewers\":null,\"requested_team_reviewers\":null,\"diff\":null,\"comments\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-10-27T02:07:21Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-27T02:22:24Z\",\"closed_at\":null,\"merged_at\":null,\"commits\":11,\"changed_files\":341,\"additions\":10701,\"deletions\":0,\"display_url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/264\",\"display_title\":\"docs(qualification): archive RC10 scripted terminal evidence\"},\"isError\":false}}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17b23-4ce0-7c11-90c6-74e78e580449","create_time":1793069503.0170867}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
