{"timestamp":"2026-10-27T02:52:03.506Z","ordinal":399707,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a17b45-a232-7c42-83c3-5a57001638d8","call_id":"call_4e9b5502ae534521b3a8944984aaaedd","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 5.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"39d797\",\"wall_time_seconds\":5.000876007,\"session_id\":61528,\"original_token_count\":362,\"output\":\"- Working: write_file\\n✔ Working: write_file\\n- Working: task_completed\\n✔ Working: task_completed\\n  ✔ a child's change is the parent's change: the parent cannot finish as NOT_REQUIRED (2184.926837ms)\\n- Working: read_file\\n✔ Working: read_file\\n  ✔ a read-only child report still completes (legitimate NOT_REQUIRED) (884.082648ms)\\n✔ I1: spawn_subagent cannot manufacture success (8072.081054ms)\\n▶ G: compaction never lets a recalled result satisfy completion\\n  ✔ the qualification workload (4 x 25 KB at a 40k limit) ends UNVERIFIED, not COMPLETED/NOT_REQUIRED (4136.730224ms)\\n  ✔ re-reading exactly what compaction removed re-establishes the result (NOT_REQUIRED) (10373.885158ms)\\n  ✔ detail-budget reduction: truncated or elided output counts as removed; output kept verbatim does not (84.959895ms)\\n  ✔ output an earlier summary kept verbatim counts as removed when a later compaction drops it (trusted and restored records) (74.982422ms)\\n  ✔ restart after compaction: a resumed conversation still knows what it no longer holds (6236.795794ms)\\n  ✔ a durable operation over the workload blocks with the reason instead of completing (4230.062929ms)\\n✔ G: compaction never lets a recalled result satisfy completion (25138.941024ms)\\n▶ I6: only the operator environment and config.env decide where a stored credential goes\\n  ✔ the stored credential reaches its own gateway, and a foreign endpoint gets none (3764.473179ms)\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17b23-4ce0-7c11