/127.0.0.1:32067, locality: loopback_ip), model claude-x. Task content — prompts, tool results and file excerpts — is sent to this provider.\\n✔ Nexus is considering the next step\\n\\n💭 Assistant: from claude\\n\\n\\n✓ TURN ENDED - NO CHANGES TO VERIFY  execution=COMPLETED outcome=NOT_REQUIRED modelStop=FINAL_TEXT\\n\\n  ✔ sidecar: models.list, provider.connect with a key, model.select switches the session to the provider (727.815718ms)\\n  ✔ sidecar: local endpoint setup verifies and scopes a key, then exposes its models for selection (210.449417ms)\\n  ✔ sidecar: failed local settings persistence restores the exact credential state (451.122028ms)\\n  ✔ sidecar: unrelated provider cancellation preserves setup and explicit local-picker clear removes it (299.407752ms)\\n  ✔ sidecar: cancelling local endpoint discovery prevents a late response from activating setup (345.417845ms)\\n  ✔ sidecar: malformed credential store is preserved when local selection cannot persist (177.767643ms)\\n  ✔ sidecar: cancelling provisional local setup preserves prior selection and does not store its key (191.403714ms)\\n✔ connecting from the picker (2694.167419ms)\\n✔ a Responses reply stopped by a content filter is a refusal; one cut at the output limit is truncation (2.853158ms)\\n✔ a compatible server declared key-less by the operator is connected (PRV-14) (3.081289ms)\\n✔ addFallbackEndpoint is a no-op on pinned provider connections and normalizes local endpoints (PRV-13) (2.905846ms)\\n✔ stream parser handles tool name chunks, repeated tool names, and object arguments (PRV-04 / REQ-PRV-105) (111.770562ms)\\n✔ non-streaming chat completion serializes object-typed tool arguments (REQ-PRV-105) (24.004118ms)\\n✔ stream parser captures delta.reasoning_content and delta.reasoning (REQ-PRV-105) (14.230453ms)\\n▶ provider condition classification\\n  ✔ auth failures are AUTH_FAILURE and are not temporary (12) (2.93192ms)\\n  ✔ HTTP status semantics: refusals are NOT_EXECUTED, post-admission 5xx are UNKNOWN (0.928677ms)\\n  ✔ transport: only proof that nothing was sent makes a failure NOT_EXECUTED (0.893325ms)\\n  ✔ provider hints: Retry-After (seconds and HTTP-date), retry-after-ms, rate-limit resets, body codes (3.956933ms)\\n✔ provider condition classification (11.066234ms)\\n▶ backoff and policy\\n  ✔ backoff stays within configured bounds for every attempt and jitter value (7) (1.447841ms)\\n  ✔ defaults tolerate the observed ~6.5 minute gateway outage and are finite; env overrides are validated (0.607822ms)\\n✔ backoff and policy (2.558944ms)\\n▶ recovery controller\\n  ✔ provider unavailable across several backoff intervals: probes only, then one resubmission (3) (4.41558ms)\\n  ✔ survives the ~6.5 minute outage class with default policy and resumes (7.232705ms)\\n  ✔ cancellation while waiting stops immediately and is reported as CANCELLED (4) (2.154838ms)\\n  ✔ deadline exhaustion rethrows the original failure with an EXHAUSTED record (5) (1.855917ms)\\n  ✔ no tight retry loop: a provider that never returns gets few, spaced attempts (6) (68.303299ms)\\n  ✔ 429 with Retry-After waits the advertised time, then resubmits without probing (8) (1.008207ms)\\n  ✔ 429 whose Retry-After exceeds the deadline is EXHAUSTED without waiting (0.708284ms)\\n  ✔ 429 without Retry-After uses exponential backoff (9) (2.743974ms)\\n  ✔ permanent request rejection and auth failure are not retried (11, 12) (2.332143ms)\\n  ✔ a request proven not admitted is resubmitted as often as the deadline allows (13) (1.883676ms)\\n  ✔ ambiguous execution is never blindly replayed: probe first, bounded replays, fresh linked ids (14) (2.696382ms)\\n  ✔ recovery disabled (deadline 0) and foreign errors are surfaced unchanged (1.06369ms)\\n✔ recovery controller (98.167493ms)\\n⚠️ [Failover] chatCompletionStream failed on http://127.0.0.1:37735/v1 (Inference error (HTTP 503): {}). Trying backup endpoint http://127.0.0.1:35697/v1...\\n\\n⚡ Failover: Active inference endpoint switched to http://127.0.0.1:35697/v1\\n⚠️ [Failover] chatCompletionStream failed on http://127.0.0.1:17469/v1 (Inference error (HTTP 429): {}). Trying backup endpoint http://127.0.0.1:21101/v1...\\n\\n⚡ Failover: Active inference endpoint switched to http://127.0.0.1:21101/v1\\n⚠️ [Failover] chatCompletionStream failed on http://127.0.0.1:33143/v1 (Inference request failed: fetch failed (cause: ECONNREFUSED: connect ECONNREFUSED 127.0.0.1:33143)). Trying backup endpoint http://127.0.0.1:23091/v1...\\n\\n⚡ Failover: Active inference endpoint switched to http://127.0.0.1:23091/v1\\n▶ client: failover and empty-stream re-request under ambiguity\\n  ✔ failover is immediate only when the primary provably did not execute (15) (207.499176ms)\\n[nexus] Empty stream from endpoint; re-requesting non-streaming completion (executions: 2).\\n  ✔ a failed empty-stream re-request is reported under its own id and is not re-requested again (16) (28.741241ms)\\n  ✔ 401 is AUTH_FAILURE, not failover-eligible, and carries provider hints (12) (13.139109ms)\\n  ✔ probeAvailability is side-effect free and reports a refused endpoint as temporarily unavailable (16.218987ms)\\n✔ client: failover and empty-stream re-request under ambiguity (266.601228ms)\\n✔ the default wait between probes is capped at 15 s, so recovery resumes soon after the provider is back (1.502859ms)\\n[provider_capabilities] reason=step model=m context 65536 (client_default); output allowance 8192 (client_default); discovery unavailable (fetch failed); token counting unsupported\\n[context_admission] step=1 request_id=38e73246-0223-4c6e-a318-5d712b096888 state=admitted estimated_tokens=4481 completion_reserve=8192 tool_response_reserve=4096 limit=65536 compacted=false messages=2\\n[token_count] step=1 request_id=38e73246-0223-4c6e-a318-5d712b096888 source=client_estimate prompt_tokens=4481 client_estimate=4481 context_limit=65536 (client_default) output_allowance=8192 (client_default) tool_headroom_policy=4096 unmeasured=\\\"capability discovery unavailable (fetch failed)\\\"\\n- Nexus is considering the next step\\n✖ Inference provider temporarily unavailable\\n⏳ Provider recovery (step 1): network_error, execution NOT_EXECUTED; next check in 1s (request 38e73246-0223-4c6e-a318-5d712b096888).\\n⏳ Provider recovery (step 1): network_error, execution NOT_EXECUTED; next check in 2s (request 38e73246-0223-4c6e-a318-5d712b096888).\\n⏳ Provider recovery (step 1): network_error, execution NOT_EXECUTED; next check in 3s (request 38e73246-0223-4c6e-a318-5d712b096888).\\n\\n💭 Assistant: recovered answer\\n✓ Provider recovered after 5s; step 1 completed on attempt 2.\\n\\n\\n\\n✓ TURN ENDED - NO CHANGES TO VERIFY  execution=COMPLETED outcome=NOT_REQUIRED modelStop=FINAL_TEXT\\n\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17b23-4ce0-7c11-90c6-74e78e580449","create_time":1793069954.3550014}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
