active; not merged-head evidence for current main., doctor_root_cause_reconciled=Current main includes PR151: D1 event-loop starvation fixed, D2 index/schema2 false warning fixed, D3 unlisted gateway model now advisory with --deep verification. Remaining measured D1b: async serial lstat over 53,376 entries still makes integrity.check exceed 5s and warn. Focused concurrent-batch fix underway; not yet tested., doctor_d1b_pr=PR #155 opened at https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/155; head 76b34f1d18d766b06011176a85679e7c3434ba30, base 382e0182795ad08332c30a7f798b94c525f8f068. Independent review ACCEPT. Focused doctor tests 5/5 and tsc --noEmit pass. Exact PR CI run39893335185 and CodeQL39893335167 in progress. No merge yet., main_latest_ci=Run39891501513 exact main 382e018: Node22 and Node24 full suites SUCCESS; Linux package job still in progress. CodeQL39891501527 SUCCESS. Prior PR153 post-merge run39891244410 on 429bd314 remains historical and Linux packaging in progress; not needed to combine with current-main evidence., custody_ref\\n[Response shortened; request fewer selected records for more detail.]\"}]}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17b23-4ce0-7c11-90c6-74e78e580449","create_time":1793069974.1483245}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
